 asics</a></p><br><br><p>Drawing\, an introductory class to using graphite p
 encil to create. We will be learning many techniques for drawing realistica
 lly as well as some ideas to jump start creativity. You will be impressed w
 ith how well you can draw when you learn to see like an artist! Charis is p
 assionate about sharing her love of drawing and each class will build on ea
 ch other to help students succeed and draw confidently.<br><br>Skill Level-
  Beginners<br>Ages- 14 +<br>Students will need to bring a 9 x 12 inch sketc
 hbook to every class.<br>$175 for the 8 classes\, with most supplies provid
 ed<br><br>Sundays from 3pm-5pm<br><br>Jan 12\, 19\, 26<br>Feb 2\, 9\, 16\,
 23<br>March 2</p><p></p><hr /><br><br><h2>What To Bring</h2><br><ul><li>Stu
 dents will need to bring a 9 x 12 inch sketchbook to every class.</li></ul>
