DESCRIPTION:<span style="background-color: var(--textfield-surface)\;">Let’
 s Draw! Have you ever wanted to be able to draw a flower on a hike or draw
 a portrait of your best friend or dog? Maybe you just want a fun way to spa
 rk your creative mind and drawing skills. Join local artist Sara L. Broers
 Brown and explore the magic of mindful-based drawing which is the foundatio
 n for 2-D and 3-D art as well as design. All levels of drawing enthusiasts
 are invited from beginners to professionals. Let’s get ready to draw! Each
 class will vary with warm-ups\, themes\, and materials. Participants are en
 couraged to bring their own sketchbook\, pencil and felt pen. Basic materia
 ls will be provided as well as media specific to the workshop such as paste
 ls and paints. Sign up by 12 pm the Tuesday before.&nbsp\;&nbsp\;</span><br
 >$60 per &nbsp\;2 hour workshop &nbsp\;<br>Thursday\, January 19\, 6-8 pm -
 &nbsp\;<a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/lets-draw-tickets-499934677077
 " style="background-color: var(--textfield-surface)\;" id="ow1288" __is_own
 er="true">https://www.eventbrite.com/e/<wbr>lets-draw-tickets-499934677077<
 /a><br>Wednesday January 25\, 12-2 pm-&nbsp\;<a href="https://www.eventbrit
 e.com/e/lets-draw-tickets-499948578657" style="background-color: var(--text
 field-surface)\;" id="ow1306" __is_owner="true">https://www.eventbrite.com/
 e/lets-draw-tickets-499948578657</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20230102T170120Z
