DESCRIPTION:<br><h1><strong>Summer on the Streets 2022!</strong></h1><p>The
  Summer on the Streets Art Markets\, Pop Up Concerts and Film Series (NEW!)
  will return to Downtown Longmont this Summer!&nbsp\; We will be on Kimbark
  and 4th Avenue from 4pm-8pm every Saturday from July 9 through August 27st
 .</p><br><h3><strong style="font-size: 14px\;">Planning Your Visit</strong>
 <br></h3><br><p>The 2022 Summer on the Streets layout will look different t
 his year\, providing a one stop Downtown location for fun\, music\, activit
 ies and local art markets.<br>Kimbark will be closed in front of the Longmo
 nt Public Library\, providing a space for the community to roam.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20220523T160655Z
LOCATION:Kimbark St & 4th Ave\, Longmont\, CO 80501\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Summer on the Streets- CHALKMONT
TRANSP:OPAQUE
