 2\, 9:00 AM</p><p>(GMT-06:00) Mountain Time (US &amp\; Canada)</p><br><b>St
 aff Member</b><p>Bettina Reiser</p><br><b>Location</b><p>Fire House Art Cen
 ter\, 667 4th Avenue\, Longmont\, CO 80501</p><b>BOOK</b><br><b>Description
 </b><p>Ms. B will have a few projects &#39\;up her sleeve&#39\; for you to
 create on your non-school day. Supplies will be provided. Please bring a sn
 ack!</p>
