DESCRIPTION:<p>What: Play with Clay Night </p><p>Who: Anyone interested in
 handbuilding ceramics</p><p><span>Sign up here\;: </span><a href="https://w
 ww.eventbrite.com/e/play-with-clay-night-june-2023-tickets-637821570487">Pl
 ay with Clay Night-June 2023 Tickets\, Wed\, Jun 28\, 2023 at 6:00 PM | Eve
 ntbrite</a></p><p><span>Where: Firehouse Art Center Ceramics Studio (Upstai
 rs)- 667 4th Ave Longmont\, CO</span></p><p>Join us for a casual gathering
 to play with clay and meet fellow clay lovers. Open to folks of all levels\
