DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/clay-mask-making-workshop
 -with-ana-balzan-tickets-777940369587?aff=oddtdtcreator">Clay Mask Making W
 orkshop with Ana Balzan Tickets\, Sun\, Jan 14\, 2024 at 2:00 PM | Eventbri
 te</a><br><br><p>Join Ana Balzan in this fun mask making workshop.</p><p>An
 a will help students in...</p><p>• The skull basics - checking height\, wid
 th &amp\; length of the head with the help of a generic proportions calcula
 tor.</p><p>• Using additive processes to create realistic features and bone
  structure while applying face proportions learned.</p><p>• Adding masses a
 nd developing the primary features: nose\, lips and eyeballs.</p><p>• Gradu
 al detailing\, fussing and checking symmetry</p><p>• Creating a human mask
 with Ana’s assistance making features of their choosing.</p><p>• Ana will p
 rovide 3 female face images.</p><p>• Creating slip to join clay pieces toge
 ther.</p><p>• Clean surface with scrubby pad and terry cloth</p><p>• Learni
 ng to refine and re-shape the features to create their vision with as much
 or little realism as desired.</p><p>• Form holes to enable the mask to be d
 isplayed on a wall with string or wire.</p><p>The masks will be fired (bisq
 ue firing is included in the price) and students will be able to pick up 2
 weeks after the class. They can then be taken home to paint\, or can be gla
 zed at the Firehouse and refired for $15.</p><p><br></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20240110T193557Z
LOCATION:Firehouse Art Center\, 667 4th Avenue\, Longmont\, CO 80501
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Clay Mask Making Workshop with Ana Balzan
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
