 ning their area after class. For distancing reasons\, each person will need
  a separate table or must bring their own easel. No materials will be provi
 ded or shared. Space is LIMITED.</p><p>Discount pricing for Firehouse Artis
 t members\, space is limited. Doors close 5 minutes after class start and o
 pen 15 minutes before.</p>
