 s\, Sat\, Aug 6\, 2022 at 5:30 PM | Eventbrite</a><br><br><br><br><br><stro
 ng><b>Learning to flow- Alcohol Ink Art workshop at the Firehouse Art Cente
 r with Homa</b></strong><br><br><h2>About this event</h2><br><br><p>Alcohol
  Ink Art workshop at the Firehouse Art Center with Homa&nbsp\;</p><p>Includ
 es Inner critic discussion and meditation. Practice to surrender and let go
  of control ... Embrace imperfection and intuition.</p><p>Learn the basics
 of alcohol ink and practice these techniques:&nbsp\;&nbsp\;</p><p>1. Wispy/
 blow composition&nbsp\;</p><p>2. Ripples</p><p>3. Flowers.</p><p>4. Finding
  meaning in form on 12x9 Nara paper.</p><p>All materials are included*&nbsp
 \;for 2 1/2 hours of instruction. &nbsp\;$68 per person.&nbsp\;For ages 14+
 .&nbsp\;Suitable for beginner\, intermediate and advanced inkers</p><p>LIMI
 TED SPOTS (10 total)&nbsp\;</p><p>*&nbsp\;If you have a simple hair dryer w
 ith low heat and pressure setting (up to 1000 watt) please bring it with yo
 u.&nbsp\;I really like this one and it is super affordable:&nbsp\;Amazon.co
 m: Conair 2-in-1 Hot Air Curling Combo: Appliances</p><p></p><p>www.soul-pa
 int.com&nbsp\;</p><p>Questions: E-mail&nbsp\;homa@soul-paint.com</p>
