CREATED:20190822T003017Z
DESCRIPTION:IN Person!\n\nJoin the Firehouse Art Center Writers for our Mon
 thly Last Friday Poetry Night.  Poetry is an opportunity\, it gives us the
 chance to celebrate and commemorate all the wonderful moments in our lives
 from the simplest smiles to the most momentous victories. It also enables u
 s to cope in challenging times. With poetry\, we can address our problems\,
  come to terms with them\, and work to grow past them. It has the potential
  to move across the spectrum of human experience in a cathartic and often b
 eautiful way. Please only read original work.  This event is free but the F
 irehouse Art Center\, as a 501c3 non-profit organization always appreciates
  donations.
LAST-MODIFIED:20241113T133403Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:POETRY NIGHT- CANCELLED DUE TO THE HOLIDAYS!
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;TZID=America/Denver:20211110T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Denver:20211110T190000
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;WKST=SU;COUNT=2;BYDAY=WE
DTSTAMP:20261030T045920Z
UID:0og6nrf2hln35bclpn9md00s2l@google.com
CREATED:20211110T173325Z
DESCRIPTION:To sign up-&nbsp\;<a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/coil-up
 -and-relax-tickets-205418200367" id="ow6150" __is_owner="true">Coil Up and
 Relax Tickets\, Wed\, Nov 10\, 2021 at 6:00 PM | Eventbrite</a><br><h3>Date
  and time</h3><br><time><p>Wed\, Nov 10\, 2021\, 6:00 PM –</p><p>Wed\, Nov
 17\, 2021\, 8:00 PM MST</p></time><br><br><br><br><br><br><strong>A simple
 and laid back class that we will be creating a ceramic basket from clay!</s
 trong><br><br><h2>About this event</h2><br><br><h3>In this adult class we w
 ill be creating a multi-functional ceramic basket using the coil hand build
 ing method. This unique process can create some very striking and whimsical
  pieces\, perfect for fruit on your kitchen table or to hold toiletries. Th
 e choice is yours!</h3><h3></h3><p>The first class we will go over the basi
 c technique of coil building and the various ways you can alter your projec
 t to suit your needs. As well as build our baskets using clay strips and a
 bowl form.</p><p>The second class we will be glazing and decorating our bas
 kets!</p><p>The final fired piece will be ready for pick up 7 to 10 days af
 ter the last class.</p><p>Open studio time is available if additional time
 is needed.</p><p>The class is geared towards adults\, but teens are welcome
  too. Some snacks will be available and feel free to bring a drink for your
 self or to share!</p><p>“mommy juice” is welcome too \;)</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20211110T173325Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Coil Up and Relax Clay class for teens and adults
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
