DESCRIPTION:<h1>Veterans Day Parade</h1><p><strong>Thursday Nov 11 | 11 am<
 br>Main St./Coffman St. between 3rd and Longs Peak Ave.</strong></p><p>We a
 re proud to announce that the Veterans Day Parade will be held this year!&n
 bsp\;Come out and show your support to the people who have served our wonde
 rful country.</p><p><strong>Road Closure</strong>&nbsp\;- 9am until&nbsp\;p
 arade ends (approximate 12 pm)</p><ul><li>Main St. - between 3rd and Longs
 Peak Ave. (traffic will be diverted at 9th Ave.) *</li><li>Coffman St. - be
 tween 3rd and Longs Peak Ave. *</li><li>3rd Ave. - between Main and Coffman
  St.</li></ul><p>No Parking signs will be placed in advance listing the dat
 e of the closure.&nbsp\;<br>* Only local traffic will be able to travel on
 Coffman and Main St. between Longs Peak Ave. and 9th Ave.</p>
