 ng 8/25/22 - (ages 15yrs and older)</h4><p>2 hr 30 min|Donation</p><br><p>W
 e will work through Julia Cameron&#39\;s &quot\;The Artist&#39\;s Way&quot\
 ; and will discover and recover our creative Self. This 13 week spiritual p
 ath path to Higher Creativity is facilitated by Bettina Reiser/Tangle Turtl
 e Art. Highly Recommended for Creatives!Please register for the Circle\, so
  we know how many to expect. Thank you!&quot\;The Artist&#39\;s Way brings
 much insight\, gently helping you see what is holding you back\, and showin
 g you how to move forward&quot\; - Elizabeth Gilbert</p>
