DESCRIPTION:Sally L. Fulton will read from her new book of poetry\, Holding
  Onto Nothing\, published by Austin Macauley Publishers\, and she will have
  books available to sign. She hopes that you will join her\n\nSally's poetr
 y of grief\, dissent\, gratitude\, and illumination illustrates the mystery
  of each life\, as well as its fragility and reminds us that we are  all a
 part of something greater\, and that each life is part of that unity.\nSall
 y's first book of poetry\, My Life So Far: Breathing Lessons was awarded fi
 rst place in the Colorado Independent Publishers Association EVVY Awards in
  2018.
LAST-MODIFIED:20231020T155752Z
SEQUENCE:0
