DESCRIPTION:<p>Join us for a fun-filled painting event with the talented ar
 tist Miya at the <strong><b><strong><b>Firehouse Art Center</b></strong></b
 ></strong>! Let your creativity flow as Miya guides you through creating yo
 ur own masterpiece. No experience necessary - just bring your enthusiasm an
 d a willingness to try something new! This in-person event is a fantastic o
 pportunity to relax\, socialize\, and unleash your inner artist. Don't miss
  out on this unique chance to explore your artistic side with Miya at the F
 irehouse Art Center!</p><p>Hi I’m Miya Orton\, I am an artist in my senior
 year of high school. My passion is to paint and I love teaching others. I l
 ove seeing peoples’ twists on their paintings. Not everything needs to be p
 erfect\, and mistakes are encouraged! We are gathering to have fun while pu
 rsuing imagination.</p><p>Silver Mist- August 23<br>Ethereal Heights- Augus
 t 30 (Studio 64)<br>Reflections- Sept 6<br>Wings of Color- Sept 27<br>Deser
 t Glow- Oct 4</p><p><a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/painting-with-miy
 a-wings-of-color-tickets-966681439207">https://www.eventbrite.com/e/paintin
 g-with-miya-wings-of-color-tickets-966681439207</a><br></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20240919T205711Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Painting with Miya- Wings of Color- South Gallery
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
