DESCRIPTION:<h1>Your Community's Landscape</h1><br><a href="https://www.eve
 ntbrite.com/e/your-communitys-landscape-tickets-472820959217" id="ow2547" _
 _is_owner="true">Your Community's Landscape Tickets\, Sat\, Jan 14\, 2023 a
 t 1:00 PM | Eventbrite</a><p><strong>Watercolor and collage collaborative p
 aper art "quilt"</strong></p><br><br><br><a href="https://www.eventbrite.co
 m/o/firehouse-art-center-12159697197" id="ow2510" __is_owner="true">Firehou
 se Art Center</a><br><span style="background-color: var(--textfield-surface
 )\;">This workshop is about expressing your neighborhood landscape. The att
 endees will bring a photo of their own house or others that they like in th
 e neighborhood or a printed house they would like to live in. We will cut a
 nd paste hand-made papers in landscape forms that we would like to see to b
 eautify the homes and community neighborhood. Bring scissors or exacto knif
 e to cut with. Glue will be provided with glue brushes. The photos will be
 mounted on 12” square paper provided and then sewn together to form a commu
 nity landscape. You must bring a photo of your home\, (past\, present\, fut
 ure\, or favorite) to represent in the collaborative artwork.</span><br><br
 ><p></p><p>T﻿he created artworks will be stitched together and included in
 Nancy Eastman's\, the Firehouse Winter Artist in Residence\, February Main
 Gallery Exhibit. Thank you for supporting art and creativity in the communi
 ty!</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20230102T202215Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Your Community's Landscape- Workshop with Nancy Eastman
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
