DESCRIPTION:Come learn\, craft\, draw\, paint and sculpt with Miss Elaine a
 nd the Firehouse Art Center!<br><br>Butterfly Stained Glass!  Learn about p
 atterns\, techniques for real stained glass and a way to repliate using glu
 e and markers!<br><br>Supplies:<br>Sharpies (permanent markers)\, White glu
 e in bottle\, <b>Black acrylic paint</b>\, <b>Clear file folder\,</b> paper
 <br><b><br></b><br><b>If you need a clear file folder\, or a little bit of
 black acrylic paint (bring your glue bottle so we can mix it in!)\, you can
  come pick up at the gallery!</b><br><br>Throughout the summer\, the Fireho
 use Art Center is offering free virtual kids art classes on Tuesdays and Th
 ursdays on their Facebook page. The videos will be filmed LIVE at 1pm on Tu
 esday and Thursday\, but will remain on the Firehouse Facebook page and the
 ir YouTube channel to watch and create later as well. If you watch LIVE you
  can comment\, ask questions and craft alongside the instructor.<br><br>For
  the upcoming weeks class schedule please visit <a href="https://www.facebo
 ok.com/Firehouseart/">https://www.facebook.com/Firehouseart</a>. A supply l
 ist and project description will be listed as an event\, but the livestream
  will be on the main Firehouse Art Center Facebook page and not the event p
 age.<br><br>Themes: Tuesday's class will focus on drawing and painting whil
 e Thursday's class is multimedia<br><br>Week of June 29- Butterflies and Bu
 gs<br><br>What to do after class:<br>Please send pictures of your completed
  artwork to elaine@firehouseart.org\, or post it to the event page that cor
 responds with the project. Find the events here- <a href="https://www.faceb
 ook.com/Firehouseart/">https://www.facebook.com/Firehouseart</a><br><br>Mak
 e sure to check out our website\, <a href="https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=h
 ttps%3A%2F%2Fwww.firehouseart.org%2F%3Ffbclid%3DIwAR3wtjKJdZBUVpqV58NHCokhM
