DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://events.humanitix.com/painting-with-miya">Paint
 ing with Miya | Humanitix</a><br><br><p><strong><b><strong><b>Painting with
  Miya</b></strong></b></strong></p><p>Join us for a fun-filled painting eve
 nt with the talented artist Miya at the <strong><b><strong><b>Firehouse Art
  Center</b></strong></b></strong>! Let your creativity flow as Miya guides
 you through creating your own masterpiece. No experience necessary - just b
 ring your enthusiasm and a willingness to try something new! This in-person
  event is a fantastic opportunity to relax\, socialize\, and unleash your i
 nner artist. Don't miss out on this unique chance to explore your artistic
 side with Miya at the Firehouse Art Center!</p><p>Hi I’m Miya Orton\, I am
 an artist in my senior year of high school. My passion is to paint and I lo
 ve teaching others. I love seeing peoples’ twists on their paintings. Not e
 verything needs to be perfect\, and mistakes are encouraged! We are gatheri
 ng to have fun while pursuing imagination.</p><p>Hi I’m Miya Orton\, I am a
 n artist in my senior year of high school. My passion is to paint and I lov
 e teaching others. I love seeing peoples’ twists on their paintings. Not ev
 erything needs to be perfect\, and mistakes are encouraged! We are gatherin
 g to have fun while pursuing imagination.</p><p>Desert Glow- Oct 4<br>Pumpk
 in Starry Night- Oct 11<br>Autumn Forest- Oct 25<br>Dia de los Muertos: Nov
  1</p><p>PLEASE MAKE SURE TO PURCHASE THE TICKETS FOR YOUR SPECIFIC DATE AN
 D PAINTING!</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20240928T033531Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Studio 64- Painting with Miya- Autumn Forest
