DESCRIPTION:<p><i><b>Join us on Thursday\, May 16</b><sup><b>th</b></sup><b
 > at 6 PM at the Firehouse Art Center.</b></i></p><p><i><b>Sign up here- </
 b></i><a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/still-photography-film-hack-tic
 kets-893261558367?aff=oddtdtcreator" target="_blank">https://www.eventbrite
 .com/e/<wbr />still-photography-film-hack-<wbr />tickets-893261558367?aff=<
 wbr />oddtdtcreator</a><i><b> </b></i></p><p>As film continues its glorious
  comeback\, rolls of 35mm still photography film have become increasingly e
 xpensive. But you\, dear celluloid fiend\, can get around this financial ba
 rrier by purchasing motion picture film in bulk and making your own still p
 hotography film rolls! In May\, cinematographer and film aficionado\, Garri
 t Speiss\, will show us how it's done. </p><p><i>We invite you to bring alo
 ng your 35mm photography cameras to test out your rolls.</i><br></p>
