DESCRIPTION:\nDuring this participatory workshop\, led by members of the Bo
 ulder County Arts Leadership Forum (BCALF)\, we'll make art to leave in odd
  places for passersby to discover and keep or re-abandon. We will begin by
 showing examples of Art Abandonment\, a growing practice to increase the ac
 cessibility of art. As we create matchbox dioramas\, collage magnets and em
 bellished clothespins\, paintings\, and more\, we'll invite participants to
  talk about unique arts initiatives in their communities. Following the wor
 kshop\, we'll "abandon" our creations around Longmont and beyond.\n\nBoulde
 r County Arts Alliance (BCAA) mission is to support and advocate for artist
 s and arts organizations in Boulder County by fostering collaborations\, sh
 aring resources\, facilitating discussions and creating opportunities to ex
 perience art.\nIt's FREE but you must register here: http://bit.ly/ArtAband
 oment1
LAST-MODIFIED:20190816T195616Z
LOCATION:300 Suns Brewing\, 335 1st Ave\, Longmont\, CO 80501\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Art Abandonment Workshop
TRANSP:OPAQUE
