 rt-on-vinyl-time-tickets-716952172247?aff=oddtdtcreator">Firehouse Artist S
 ocial- Art on Vinyl Time Tickets\, Sat\, Sep 23\, 2023 at 5:30 PM | Eventbr
 ite</a><br><br><p>Firehouse Artist Social : Art on Vinyl</p><p>Artist Membe
 rship Social is a space to connect with fellow thinkers and doers! Connect
 with real people in an ultra casual and family style space! Art on Vinyl is
  a night of music\, friends and art. Bring your brushes and paints and list
 en to curated classics provided by new Longmont local business Vinyl Cafe a
 s well as bring your own to spin on the speakers. You will be provided a re
 purposed record as your canvas\, paint whatever speaks to you through the m
 usic and people and consider donating them back to The Vinyl Cafe so they c
 an use it as decor in their business located on Main Street in Downtown Lon
 gmont. Food is provided by host and fellow Firehouse member Angel Corsi who
  will share a couple of easy favorites from his former restaurant Melodia h
 e was operating before moving to Colorado. Enjoy the Italian/Spanish fusion
  family style food or bring your own and let the music guide your paint bru
 sh while you connect with new friends of all generations from the Firehouse
  Art Center roster of diverse artists. This event is only for F.A.C Members
  but you are welcome to bring a guest!</p><p>Hosted by: Angel Corsi</p><p>S
 ponsored by: Firehouse Art Center &amp\; The Vinyl Cafe</p>
