CREATED:20231212T174913Z
DESCRIPTION:<h1>Eco Elegance Unlocked Talk: Design Principles for Fashion R
 ebels</h1><p><strong>Break free from the fast fashion habit</strong></p><br
 ><section><br><br><br>By <strong>Fashion REBELution</strong><br><br><span>D
 o you love Mother Natures and is your idea of a wild night one filled with
 creative shenanigans? If you get a kick out of finding treasures and think
 shared knowledge is more powerful than your morning coffee\, then this talk
  is for you. We’ll dive headfirst into the world of sustainable fashion unr
 aveling the guiding principles and fabulous allure hidden in our pre-love t
 extiles. Expect an engaging discussion where questions and ideas take cente
 r stage. Whether you’re a seasoned eco-warrior or just dipping a perfectly
 manicured toe toes into sustainable waters\, this talk is tailor-made for y
 ou. Let’s weave our potential into a future that’s not only conscious but d
 ownright fabulous.</span></section><section><section><br><br><b><h3>Sign up
  for this free talk here- <a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/eco-eleganc
 e-unlocked-talk-design-principles-for-fashion-rebels-tickets-767821313217?a
 ff=oddtdtcreator">Eco Elegance Unlocked Talk: Design Principles for Fashion
  Rebels Tickets\, Wed\, Jan 31\, 2024 at 6:30 PM | Eventbrite</a></h3></b><
 /section></section>
