DESCRIPTION:<p>Turkeys loose in the Art room!</p><p>Dates: November 22<sup>
 nd</sup>\, 23<sup>rd</sup>\, and 24<sup>th</sup></p><p>Ages: 7 and up</p><p
 >Times: 9am to 12noon</p><p>Price: $30 per day or $60 for all 3 days!</p><p
 > </p><p>Kids home for a few days and want to occupy their time with someth
 ing more than a Minecraft marathon? Then pop into Firehouse Art Studio! We
 will be exploring different materials and mediums that your little artist c
 an take home with them at the end of the day! Everything from slime paintin
 g\, and hanging mini planters to a center piece for your Thanksgiving table
 .</p><p>Come for one day or all three! We will read a couple of silly stori
 es\, enjoy a snack (please let us know of any allergies) and explore a samp
 ling of all that art has to offer. Please have children dress in clothes th
 at can get messy. Although aprons are available\, some of the materials we
 will be using can stain clothing. A breakdown of each day will be available
  on my website <a href="http://dragonflyandcrow.wordpress.com/" target="_bl
 ank">dragonflyandcrow.wordpress.com</a></p><p></p>
