DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/abandoned-art-potluck-and
 -craft-time-tickets-404354433997">Abandoned Art Potluck and Craft Time Tick
 ets\, Sun\, Oct 23\, 2022 at 1:00 PM | Eventbrite</a><br><br><br><p><strong
 ><b>Come make some art and then have fun playing hide and seek with your ar
 t downtown.</b></strong></p><br><h2>About this event</h2><br><br><br><p>Bas
 ed on the workshop we had a couple years back\, but more fun craft time rat
 her than a class. We'll make art to leave in odd places for passersby to di
 scover and keep or re-abandon. Art Abandonment is a growing practice to inc
 rease the accessibility of art. We will provide altoid tins and Hidden Trea
 sure grab bags of "ingredients". Feel free to bring craft items\, a hot glu
 e gun\, and glue sticks\, and whatever other items you might need\, or you
 might want to share.</p><p>Following our craft time\, we'll "abandon" our c
 reations around Longmont and beyond.</p><p>Bring snackies and beverages and
  we can have a fun potluck and get to know attendees while we craft.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20220818T202300Z
LOCATION:Firehouse Art Center\, Longmont\, Colorado\, United States\, 80501
