DESCRIPTION:<br><br><strong>Sign up here: <a href="https://www.eventbrite.c
 om/e/kids-create-ceramic-christmas-gifts-tickets-218167012407" target="_bla
 nk">https://www.eventbrite.com/e/kids-create-ceramic-christmas-gifts-ticket
 s-218167012407</a></strong><br><strong><br></strong><br><strong>Kids ages 8
 + We will make a spoon rest\, a card holder and fingerprint decoration or a
  set of magnets. No gift is greater than one we create!</strong><br><br><h2
 >About this event</h2><br><br><p>This class is for kids ages 8 and up who w
 ant to share their creativity by creating some unique gifts for their famil
 y or friends. We will be making a spoon rest\, an ornament or ring holder a
 nd a card holder for the table for all the Christmas cards that come in the
  mail.</p><p>In the first class the kids will create all the items they wou
 ld like to give (the amount of gifts and what gifts they make will vary by
 the child and what they want to make. If additional time is needed we can s
 tay up to an hour later.)</p><p>For the second class\, the fired items are
 ready to be painted or glazed. If they choose to paint them\, they can be b
 rought home that night. If they prefer to glaze them (recommended for durab
 ility)\, they will be ready by December 20th\, ready to wrap and give.....
 or keep for yourself!</p><u></u>Please have your child wear clothing that c
 an get dirty as well as a water bottle or non sugary drink (in case of spil
 ls).<u></u>
LAST-MODIFIED:20211207T010059Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Kids Create: Ceramic Christmas Gifts
TRANSP:OPAQUE
