UID:1irmsb63ahhp455s3ken7lv00o@google.com
CREATED:20230322T043558Z
DESCRIPTION:Join us at the Firehouse Art Center in Longmont Colorado on Wed
 nesday\, May 10th from 6-8 PM for an in depth talk on the world of web3 art
 \, NFTs\, and the future of digital art. Our featured speaker\, Tom Ludlow
 aka Denver_Donkey\, a web3 artist and expert in the field\, will walk us th
 rough the state of the art world in the digital age.Discover the possibilit
 ies of blockchain technology and how it has allowed artists to authenticate
  and monetize their work in a way that was never before possible. Learn abo
 ut the differences between traditional digital art and web3 art\, and how t
 he use of NFTs can create unique\, one-of-a-kind pieces that are verified a
 s authentic and valuable.Explore the future of digital art and the potentia
 l for a shift from physical to digital mediums. Discuss the challenges and
 questions that arise as we move forward into the web3 space\, including iss
 ues of accessibility and inclusivity.This is an event not to be missed for
 anyone interested in the world of digital art and the possibilities of bloc
 kchain technology. While not a talk about AI art\, this is a topic that may
  be touched upon. Bring your questions!!!
LAST-MODIFIED:20230403T005538Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Artist Talk with Tom Ludlow
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
