DESCRIPTION:June 30th\n2:00 PM - 3:00 PM\nFirehouse Art Center - South Gall
 ery\n667  4th Ave\, Longmont\, CO\n\n4 Keys to Revitalize Your Relationship
 \n\nSummer is the season for renewal and growth. Everything occasionally ne
 eds extra attention in order to grow and thrive. This includes your romanti
 c relationship. Enjoy a free day out with your partner\, devoted to learnin
 g tools to enhance your communication and strengthen your emotional intimac
 y. This is sure to be a fun and heart-opening experience. An opportunity to
  explore love. \n\nCome alone\, bring your partner\, or come with a friend.
  I promise that however you show up\, you will walk away with a few new ins
 ights into what your relationship needs to blossom.\n\nThese tools are desi
 gned for romantic partnerships\, but they also work for other close relatio
 nships as well\, such as the ones that you have with your kids\, parents\,
 and siblings.\n\nThis workshop is hosted by Helaine Reiner\, a Longmont rel
 ationship coach specializing in helping couples strengthen and renew their
 connection\, intimacy\, and love.
LAST-MODIFIED:20240524T134539Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:4 Keys to Revitalize Your Relationship with Helaine Reiner
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
