DTSTAMP:20261030T045920Z
UID:5nbgodesvrjtrkiji6jhkhbui0@google.com
CREATED:20240528T202400Z
DESCRIPTION:<p><a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://queerasterisk.
 com/events/proud-to-pause/%23&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;ust=17170
 20735044648&amp\;usg=AOvVaw3jGKKszNn3eHGC5WW5ihkb" target="_blank"><strong>
 JUNE 1 – Proud to Pause Reflective Art Gathering with ShawnT Stone<br></str
 ong>Presented by Queer Asterisk</a></p><p><strong>3-5pm</strong></p><p>In t
 he midst of celebration\, it’s vital to take moments for introspection and
 self-care. That’s why we’re offering a diverse array of activities aimed at
  promoting moments of pause. Join us for soothing sound healing sessions\,
 a nature walk\, restorative community acu-detox\, expressive art-making\, a
 nd grounding mindfulness practices.</p><p>Amidst the festivities\, let’s re
 member the importance of slowing down and honoring ourselves.</p><p dir="lt
 r">Your presence and support are invaluable as we celebrate our resilience
 and honor the journey of the LGBTQ+ community. Join us in embracing the spi
 rit of Proud to Pause this Pride Month</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20240528T202400Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Studio 64- Reflective Art Making- https://queerasterisk.com/events/
 proud-to-pause/#
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
