DESCRIPTION:This new group plans to meet on the second Monday of every mont
 h from 12:00 noon - 2:30 PM beginning July 11\, 2022 with the goal of worki
 ng on individual projects while sharing creative energies and inspiration\,
 <br><html-blob>conversation and a pot-luck meal in a casual\, supportive ga
 thering. All&nbsp\;interested individuals are invited to bring whatever cre
 ative project they&nbsp\;have in process to work on\, a healthy lunch dish
 to share and a beverage of&nbsp\;choice. No fees. Donations to The Firehous
 e are welcomed but not&nbsp\;required. Bring a friend or meet new ones. If
 you have any questions and/&nbsp\;or think you might come\, please send a t
 ext to Kathy Hall at 303-746-0629&nbsp\;so we know approximately how many t
 o set up for. Thank you.<br></html-blob>
