 trong> at <strong><b>3:00 PM (Mountain Daylight Time)</b></strong>.</p><p>O
 ur club meets at <strong><b>667 4th Avenue\, Longmont\, CO 80501</b></stron
 g>\, a vibrant and inspiring location perfect for sparking imagination.</p>
