 art techniques and mediums\, including painting\, drawing\, and sculpting.
 Our experienced instructor will guide them through exciting projects\, enco
 uraging self-expression and fostering a love for art.</p><p>Whether your ch
 ild is a budding artist or simply looking for a creative outlet\, our Kids
 After School Art Club is the perfect place for them to unwind\, have fun\,
 and make new friends. We provide all the necessary art supplies\, so just b
 ring your enthusiasm!</p><p>Don't miss out on this wonderful opportunity to
