DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://sites.google.com/view/monotype-workshop-with-a
 ndi/home">Monotype Workshop with Andi Newberry (google.com)</a> <br>  Explo
 rations in Monotype<br>Taught by Andi Newberry<br>Saturday\, March 30\, 9 a
 m-12 pm<br><br>Using plexiglass\, participants will learn different methods
  of printing monotypes\, a form of printmaking that creates delightfully su
 rprising results every time you pull a print! Some approaches covered will
 include working subtractively\, using cut paper stencils/found objects\, an
 d direct tracing. We will print both with a press and by hand to show the v
 ersatility of this medium. All supplies will be provided\, and participants
  can expect to leave with 6-10 unique prints. Open to all levels of experie
 nce in printmaking\, but recommended ages 16 and older. Bringing a sketch o
 r two is recommended (we will be working with 5x7 plexiglass plates). Maxim
 um 15 participants.<br><br>Workshop fee: $50 (includes material cost)
LAST-MODIFIED:20240130T203824Z
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Explorations in Monotype Taught by Andi Newberry
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
