DESCRIPTION:<p><a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.eventbrite
 .com/e/life-drawing-with-art-of-modeling-long-pose-tickets-272366354097&amp
 \;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;ust=1661287428520209&amp\;usg=AOvVaw0YzR0_
 TpCvhZrWpz3p22Ec" target="_blank">Life Drawing with Art of Modeling- LONG P
 OSE Tickets\, Multiple Dates | Eventbrite</a></p><p><strong><b>Life Drawing
  at the Firehouse Art Center with Art of Modeling- Long Pose</b></strong></
 p><br><h2>About this event</h2><br><br><br><p>4th Sunday of the Month\, 6pm
 -9pm</p><p>(See separate event for Monday night 2 hour life drawing)</p><p>
 The Firehouse Art Center presents a socially distanced figure drawing sessi
 on. 18+.</p><p>About this Event</p><p>The Firehouse is proud to offer a soc
 ially distanced life drawing session coordinated with Art of Modeling.</p><
 p>Long Sit- Wet media allowed but artists MUST clean up their area afterwar
 ds. 3D materials must provide further protective materials (tarps\, etc.) a
 nd must email host before class.</p><p>The Firehouse provides chairs and ta
 bles\, BYO easel and supplies.</p><p>In this three-hour session poses start
  with a few short warmups leading into one longer seated pose. This is an o
 pen-studio format. This is not an instructor-led class: artists are invited
  to practice their craft in their own style.</p><p>All artists are responsi
 ble for cleaning their area after class. For distancing reasons\, each pers
 on will need a separate table or must bring their own easel. No materials w
 ill be provided or shared. Space is LIMITED.</p><p>August Long Pose Sunday\
 , 28th\, 6-9:</p><p></p><p>-Jennifer</p><p>Discount pricing for Firehouse A
 rtist members\, space is limited. Doors close 5 minutes after class start a
 nd open 15 minutes before.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20220818T204355Z
