CREATED:20230126T143523Z
DESCRIPTION:Angel Corsi is a performing songwriter with over two decades of
  experience performing in the U.S\, Canada and Australia. Corsi has owned a
 nd operated a dedicated singer songwriter listening room venue called The P
 relude Songwriters Club and received formal training in stage presence\, ly
 ric writing\, live sound reinforcement and even created his own performing
 songwriter based program designed to elevate their songwriting\, their stag
 e presence and guide them closer to their signature sound and artist identi
 ty. Songwriter Breakthrough Master Class is an artist fulfilling extended s
 eminar event that covers all of the vital points of being a performing song
 writer and helping you connect with your audience and launching yourself in
 to the industry with tools and techniques  to not only help you find your v
 oice but to give it's most powerful impact. As a group you will hone your s
 ongwriting through real - time editing\, lyric writing lessons and for stag
 e presence\, you will receive live in- person examples to help you become a
  stronger performer on stage. There will also be a lecture on the importanc
 e of Artist Identity with exercises to get you closer to revealing who you
 are as an artist. Angel's teaching style is purposeful\, honest and can be
 challenging at times\, but he will also meet you where you are\, as in\, an
 y experience level will learn evergreen information that will help them in
 any stage of their career. This seminar is heavily focused on being the bes
 t artist you are\, where you are. It is available and held at Firehouse Art
  Center in Longmont\,CO. If you are an experienced\, working or aspiring si
 nger-songwriter looking to perform on stage\, share your original songs and
  want to focus on intentional songwriting and better stage performance then
  you are welcome to join Angel Corsi for Songwriter Breakthrough Master Cla
 ss.<br><br>Performing Songwriter Instructor: Angel Corsi<br>REGISTER FREE: 
 <a href="mailto:songwriterbreakthrough@gmail.com">songwriterbreakthrough@gm
 ail.<u></u>com</a><br>Find Angel: <a href="http://www.angelcorsi.com/">www.
 angelcorsi.com</a> | Instagram: <a>@corsisongs</a><br>UPCOMING SEMINAR: Mar
 ch 5th \, 1PM - 5PM
LAST-MODIFIED:20230303T032552Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:South- Songwriters Seminar
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
