DESCRIPTION:<p>Please join me in painting rocks for Madie McChesney's Silve
 r Creek Leadership program.  She is a high schooler at Silver Creek and her
  leadership project is all about spreading color\, creativity and kindness.
  </p><p>Madie will provide rocks and supplies\, and we will paint for 2 hou
 rs to create how ever many awesome rocks we can.</p><p>We will then hide al
 l over downtown for the upcoming 2nd Saturday creative crawl.</p><p><br></p
 ><p><a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/paint-rocks-for-you-rock-and-madi
 e-mcchesneys-schs-leadership-project-tickets-557164021587">Paint rocks for
 "You Rock" and Madie McChesney's SCHS leadership project! Tickets\, Sun\, M
 ar 5\, 2023 at 1:00 PM | Eventbrite</a><br></p><p></p>
