DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://firehouseart.org/artwalk-longmont/">https://fi
 rehouseart.org/artwalk-longmont/</a><br><h1><strong>SUMMER FESTIVALS 2024</
 strong></h1><h1><strong>SUMMER ON THE STREETS AND ARTWALK ON MAIN</strong><
 /h1><p><strong>SUMMER ON THE STREETS- With over 20 vendors\, 2 food trucks
 and live music\, we transform 4th Avenue (right in front of the Firehouse)\
 , into your monthly destination for art\, music\, and fun! Each 2nd Saturda
 y will offer different experiences and activities\, so make sure to visit e
 ach month to see what’s NEW!</strong></p><ul><li><b>MAY 11\, JUNE 8\, JULY
 13\, AUGUST 10</b></li><li><b>4pm-8pm (MAY 11 RUNS FROM 3PM-7PM)</b></li><l
 i><b>4th Ave\, between Main St. and Coffman St.</b></li><li><b>Art Market\,
  Live Music\, Food Trucks and Yard games</b></li></ul>
