DESCRIPTION:<p>What: Play with Clay Night&nbsp\;</p><p>Who: Anyone interest
 ed in handbuilding ceramics</p><p>When:August 26\, from 6-8pm</p><p>Where:
 Firehouse Art Center Ceramics Studio (Upstairs)- 667 4th Ave Longmont\, CO<
 /p><p>Join us for a casual gathering to play with clay and meet fellow clay
  lovers. Open to folks of all levels\, demos will be shown for construction
  for beginners or just come and do your own thing! Only 12 dollars and the
 class covers your clay and for your pieces to get bisque fired. You can the
 n pick up your fired work to paint at home or bring to our next Play with C
 lay night to glaze the work. Handbuilding projects only.&nbsp\;</p>
