DESCRIPTION:<br><br><br><br><b>Craftivism 101- Donation based class- please
  pay what you can<br></b><br><p></p><p></p><p></p><p><b>Get acquainted with
  craftivism\, learn to embroider\, stitch something brilliant\, and make fr
 iends—all in just 2 hours!</b></p><p></p><p>Craft-based activism has been u
 sed as a tool of resistance\, coalition building\, and even espionage! Lear
 n from Shannon Downey—a leader in the modern craftivism movement. She will
 provide an introduction to the history of craftivism and ways you can get i
 nvolved in the modern movement. Shannon will then teach you how to embroide
 r and have you stabbing it out in no time. She guarantees you walk away fee
 ling better than when you arrived.</p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p>Shannon will
 have some materials available\, but feel free to bring any of the following
 !</p><p>Materials: embroidery hoop\, embroidery floss\, 24-gauge tapestry n
 eedle\, quilters cotton square\, scissors\, water soluble marking pen</p><b
 r><br><h3></h3>
LAST-MODIFIED:20220330T164918Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:craftivism 101 with Shannon Downey
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
