DESCRIPTION:<p>Writer's Workshop: Held on the Third Friday of Each Month</p
 ><p>Where: Firehouse Art Center (667 4th Ave.)</p><p></p><p>IN PERSON!!!&nb
 sp\; Please wear a mask and meet at the Firehouse.&nbsp\; Join the Firehous
 e Art Center Writers for a helpful\, all levels\, writers workshop.&nbsp\;
 The event may include read throughs\, prompts\, sharing and more.&nbsp\; Th
 ere will be a facilitator.&nbsp\; This event is free but the Firehouse Art
 Center\, as a 501c3 non-profit organization always appreciates donations.</
 p><ul><li>June 18th at 7pm</li><li>July 16th at 7pm</li><li>August 20th at
 7pm</li><li>September 17th at 7pm</li><li>October 15th at 7pm</li><li>Novem
 ber 19th at 7pm</li><li>December 17th at 7pm</li></ul>
