DESCRIPTION:<h1>Musical Canvas @ Firehouse Art Center w/ Live Music from Ty
 ler O'Hare</h1><br><a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/musical-canvas-fir
 ehouse-art-center-w-live-music-from-tyler-ohare-tickets-669696088027">Music
 al Canvas @ Firehouse Art Center w/ Live Music from Tyler O'Hare Tickets\,
 Wed\, Jul 12\, 2023 at 6:00 PM | Eventbrite</a><p><strong>Musical Canvas co
 mbines art\, music\, and collaboration for a unique and memorable evening.
 Come express yourself through painting!</strong></p><br><br><br><br><b><h2>
 Agenda</h2></b><br><br><br><br><p>6:00 PM - 6:30 PM</p><p>Check-In</p><hr /
 ><br>Meet your host\, your canvas\, and your fellow painters!<br><br><p>6:3
 0 PM - 7:30 PM</p><p>1st Round</p><hr /><br>Learn more from your host about
  the unique nature of this event and begin expressing yourself through pain
 ting.<br><br><p>7:30 PM - 7:45 PM</p><p>Break</p><hr /><br>Need to grab ano
 ther beverage? Now's your chance!<br><br><p>7:45 PM - 8:30 PM</p><p>2nd Rou
 nd</p><hr /><br>Add the final touches to your very own piece of art.<br><b>
 <h2>About this event</h2></b><ul><li><i></i>2 hours 30 minutes</li><li><i><
 /i>Mobile eTicket</li></ul><br><br><br><p><strong><b>Hosted by Devon Tree</
 b></strong> (<em>devontreeart.com</em>) - Devon Lindsay\, also known as “Tr
 ee”\, had his nickname given to him by his uncle to reflect his Native Amer
 ican heritage\, strong physical stature\, and his deep spiritual roots. Dev
 on has been painting since 2009 and fell in love with live painting at even
 ts shortly after. He uses a variety of different mediums including acrylic
 spray paint\, and airbrush.</p><p>With his variety of styles ranging from m
 ountain landscapes to far-out psychedelic abstract paintings\, Devon took o
 n the challenge of creating original paintings from start to finish during
 live music shows for the band and concertgoers' enjoyment alike. He has als
 o performed in a variety of Colorado-based music groups across the nation.
 The crossroads of these experiences culminated in a special project\, Roote
 d Loops\, in which Devon performs live music while simultaneously painting
 a piece from start to finish.<br></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20230707T181015Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Musical Canvas @ Firehouse Art Center w/ Live Music from Tyler O'Ha
 re
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
