DESCRIPTION:Come learn\, craft\, draw\, paint and sculpt with Miss Elaine a
 nd the Firehouse Art Center!<br><br>Drawing Magnified bugs!  Learn about in
 sect anatomy and magnification.<br><br>Supplies:<br>Coloring tools (crayons
 \, colored pencils\,markers\, etc.).<br><br>Throughout the summer\, the Fir
 ehouse Art Center is offering free virtual kids art classes on Tuesdays and
  Thursdays on their Facebook page. The videos will be filmed LIVE at 1pm on
  Tuesday and Thursday\, but will remain on the Firehouse Facebook page and
 their YouTube channel to watch and create later as well. If you watch LIVE
 you can comment\, ask questions and craft alongside the instructor.<br><br>
 For the upcoming weeks class schedule please visit <a href="https://www.fac
 ebook.com/Firehouseart/">https://www.facebook.com/Firehouseart</a>. A suppl
 y list and project description will be listed as an event\, but the livestr
 eam will be on the main Firehouse Art Center Facebook page and not the even
 t page.<br><br>Themes: Tuesday's class will focus on drawing and painting w
 hile Thursday's class is multimedia<br><br>Week of June 29- Butterflies and
  Bugs<br><br>What to do after class:<br>Please send pictures of your comple
 ted artwork to elaine@firehouseart.org\, or post it to the event page that
 corresponds with the project. Find the events here- <a href="https://www.fa
 cebook.com/Firehouseart/">https://www.facebook.com/Firehouseart</a><br><br>
 Make sure to check out our website\, <a href="https://l.facebook.com/l.php?
 u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.firehouseart.org%2F%3Ffbclid%3DIwAR3wtjKJdZBUVpqV58NHCo
