DESCRIPTION:<br><b>Tuesday\, November 7th</b> at <b>Firehouse Art Center in
  Longmont from 6-8PM. </b><br><br>We're having an extra special meeting thi
 s month featuring an extra special panel about how to get your short film p
 roduction off the ground. In addition to hearing from some of the amazing s
 easoned filmmakers in this group\, we'll also have a few new faces at this
 meeting: Denver-based producer/director\, Justin Jackola\, and FoCo-based p
 roducer/writer Elizabeth Mihelich (who just happens to be the current progr
 amming chair at Women in Film &amp\; Media Colorado!!). <br><br>Seriously\,
  if you only show up for one of these meetings for the rest of your life\,
 this is the one to come to!!! It's going to be super sick\, and I personall
 y am super excited. Bring all of your film-related questions and\, as alway
 s\, get ready to hang out with some super awesome local filmmakers.
LAST-MODIFIED:20240731T192858Z
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Main Gallery- Filmmakers Meetup
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
