DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://firehouseart.org/artwalk-longmont/" target="_b
 lank">https://firehouseart.org/artwalk-longmont/</a><br><h1><p><strong>ARTW
 ALK ON MAIN- In September\, we close down Main from 3rd Avenue to Longs Pea
 k\, for 5 blocks of ART\, CULTURE\, MUSIC\, FOOD\, FUN and MORE!</strong></
 p><ul><li><b>September 14\, 2024</b></li><li><b>4pm-8pm</b></li><li><b>Main
  St. between 3rd Ave and Longs Peak Ave</b></li><li><b>Art Market\, Live Mu
 sic\, Performers\, Food Trucks\, Beer and Wine available</b></li></ul><p><b
 >Our Summer festivals close down the streets to celebrate art\, culture\, a
 nd our community!</b></p><p><strong>PERFORMANCES:</strong><br>Summer on the
  Streets features one stage with 2 performers. ArtWalk on Main features six
  stages to engage the entire community with music and performance. If you a
 re a musician or performance group interested in performing you can apply <
 strong><a href="https://forms.gle/5FoT3uUzGCZ2UGKK6">here</a>. </strong></p
 ><p><strong>ART AND MORE:</strong></p><p>Visit with Longmont artists and sh
 op a variety of creative mediums from jewelry to ceramics. Many booths will
  have interactive activities for those feeling inspired! The Firehouse Art
 Center is open until 9pm. Art vendors can apply here<strong>. <a href="http
 s://reg.planetreg.com/E913104647224456">ArtWalk</a> </strong></p><p><strong
 >BUSINESSES AND NONPROFITS:<br></strong>Share what you do with our Longmont
  Community.  Over 8\,000 visitors walk through the ArtWalk footprint! Apply
  here:<strong><a href="https://reg.planetreg.com/E913105449224544">ArtWalk<
 /a></strong></p><p><strong>FUN FOR ALL AGES:</strong><br>Looking for more f
 un? Have your face painted\, get a balloon sword\, and or snack on some cot
 ton candy.</p><p><strong>LONGMONT FOOD TRUCKS\, BREWS AND BEVERAGES:</stron
 g><br>Longmont Food Trucks will be serving up Longmont’s best. Interested F
 ood trucks please apply here<strong>. <a href="https://reg.planetreg.com/E9
 1311249224190">ArtWalk</a> </strong></p><p><strong>CHALKMONT:</strong><br>D
 uring ArtWalk on Main\, artists\, both youth and adults artists\, will be c
 reating art on the sidewalks on Main. These artists will turn Main Street i
 nto a vivid canvas of colorful chalk art. At 7:45 the Firehouse Art Center
 Exhibits Committee will vote on Best in Show for adults and youth\, with wi
 nners receiving a $100 gift card. The winner will be named on the ArtWalk L
 ongmont Facebook and Instagram pages. Interested artists can apply <strong>
 <a href="https://forms.gle/KzFFicgFTHvZumTE6">here</a>.</strong></p></h1>
LAST-MODIFIED:20240508T195339Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:ArtWalk!!!
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
