DESCRIPTION:We will be creating seasonal art cards using the Zentangle meth
 od. You will be able to take home your creations! (for age 11 and up) $50 f
 or the 2 hour class. Materials will be provided. To register\, please go up
  to the first section and sign up! &quot\;The Zentangle Method is an easy-t
 o-learn\, relaxing and fun way to create beautiful images by drawing struct
 ured patterns (tangles). It is a proven method for mindfulness\, fosters se
 lf-esteem\, focus\, relaxation\, and stress reduction. And it&#39\;s fun! P
 eople of all ages and skill levels around the world now create Zentangle Ar
 t.&quot\; - Founders Rick Roberts &amp\; Maria Thomas.<br><br>In Studio-64
 at Firehouse Art Center (Upstairs classroom)<br><br><a href="https://tangle
 turtleart.com/ola/services/seasonal-zentangle" target="_blank">Tangle Turtl
 e Art - Zentangle Inspired Art\, Pen and Ink Drawings</a>
