DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/yarn-wrapping-natural-ele
 ments-tickets-472813817857">Participate in the meditative practice of yarn
 wrapping!</a><br><a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/yarn-wrapping-natura
 l-elements-tickets-472813817857">Yarn Wrapping natural Elements Tickets\, S
 at\, Dec 17\, 2022 at 1:00 PM | Eventbrite</a><br><br><p>Wrapping sticks is
  about remembering the West with the Ute Indian culture and how they wove a
 nd used color. We will wrap sticks of different colors of yarn and place th
 em on a wall for exhibit. The attendees can collect sticks to wrap\, and so
 me sticks will be provided along with the colored yarn in the workshop. Whe
 n wrapping there is a rhythm that one gets into with your hands and eyes th
 at is meditative. The contrast of soft yarn on the bark of the stick is an
 appealing texture that delights the eye.  Please bring sticks from your nat
 ural habitat and any yarn you would like to use.  Supplies will be availabl
 e but as a community project\, it would be great to represent items found t
 hroughout the community!</p><p></p><p>T﻿hese wrapped items will be included
  in Nancy Eastman's\, the Firehouse Winter Artist in Residence\, February M
 ain Gallery Exhibit.  Thank you for supporting art and creativity in the co
 mmunity!</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20221214T213914Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Yarn Wrapping Natural Elements with Nancy Eastman
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
