DESCRIPTION:<b>Art with the Masters</b><br><p>July. 21 - Just 25</p><p>1pm
 -  5 pm - (4 hours)</p><p>Age 10-15</p><p>Join Sara Broers Brown for a week
  of making art inspired by famous artist through art history including Clau
 de Monet\, Vincent VanGogh\, Paula Klee\, Frida Kahlo and Modern Abstractio
 nist. You will explore new artistic tools throughout the week. Friday will
 be a day dedicated to creating a masterpiece that earns the honor of a fram
 e. Sara is a Colorado K-12 Licensed Art Educators and has enjoyed bringing
 exploration and inspiration to art explorers for over 25 years. Educators a
 nd has enjoyed bringing exploration and inspiration to art explorers for ov
 er 25 years.. It is optional to bring a sketchbook\, new or previously used
 \, to collect ideas\, mindful drawing\, and inspiring notes and doodles. Al
 so\, bring a water vessel with a closed lid and snack.</p>
