 house-rltw5lbv</a><br><br><p>Come make artist trading cards and Crochet goo
 dies to do art drops "Acts of Kindness" throughout town!  </p><p>We will ha
 ve ATC (2.5" x 3.5") cards precut from fine art paper (watercolor\, cardsto
 ck\, etc) as well as art materials and supplies.  Feel free to bring any su
 pplies you would like to use!</p><p>Experience the joy of creating art\, an
 d then abandoning it throughout Downtown Longmont. Then pass that joy on wh
 en some UNSUSPECTING finder finds the art!  </p><p>The Firehouse Art Center
  and Longmont Crochet Guild are hosting this event to promote Longmont Arts
  Week\, which happends between Sept. 14th and Sept 21st. Arts Week kicks of
  with ArtWalk on Main and ends with Ryhthm at Roosevelt. </p>
