DESCRIPTION:RSVP here for this free event<br><a href="https://www.eventbrit
 e.com/e/artist-member-first-friday-zoom-social-tickets-116175751801?aff=ebd
 ssbonlinesearch" id="ow1044" __is_owner="true">https://www.eventbrite.com/e
 /artist-member-first-friday-zoom-social-tickets-116175751801?aff=ebdssbonli
 nesearch</a>&nbsp\;<br><br><br><br><br><br><br><strong>Drink and Draw/Studi
 o Share/What are you working on?</strong><br><br><h2>About this Event</h2><
 br><br><p>For Firehouse Artist Members and those interested in Artist Membe
 rship- please visit https://firehouseart.org/support/join/ to learn more ab
 out our Artist Membership\, a program that supports local creatives. If you
  are interested in the Artist Membership Program and have questions\, pleas
 e email info@firehouseart.org.</p><p>Join the Firehouse Art Center for an o
 pen Drink and Draw (come any time between 5pm and 8pm). Everyone will get a
  chance to share what they are working on\, share their space and also have
  time to work on whatever they want to!</p><p></p><p>We will send out the Z
 oom link to registered participants before the event!</p><p>Click on the ZO
 OM link in your email to join\, make your own beverages and let’s drink “to
 gether” and draw! Or paint! Since it’s in your home feel free to use any su
 pply you want!</p><p>Come and go as you please\, no need to stay the whole
 time!</p><br>&nbsp\;
