UID:01v560nk0nos1raibuc36br553@google.com
CREATED:20240214T000353Z
DESCRIPTION:<strong>Musical Canvas combines art\, music\, and collaboration
  for a unique and memorable evening. Come express yourself through painting
 !</strong><br><p><strong><b>Hosted by Devon Tree</b></strong> (<em><a href=
 "https://www.google.com/url?q=http://devontreeart.com&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source
 =calendar&amp\;ust=1708300884309803&amp\;usg=AOvVaw3vkRDLpQCwphs8o1vpfbsv"
 target="_blank"><u>devontreeart.com</u></a></em>) - Devon Lindsay\, also kn
 own as “Tree”\, had his nickname given to him by his uncle to reflect his N
 ative American heritage\, strong physical stature\, and his deep spiritual
 roots. Devon has been painting since 2009 and fell in love with live painti
 ng at events shortly after. He uses a variety of different mediums includin
 g acrylic spray paint\, and airbrush.</p><p>With his variety of styles rang
 ing from mountain landscapes to far-out psychedelic abstract paintings\, De
 von took on the challenge of creating original paintings from start to fini
 sh during live music shows for the band and concertgoers&#39\; enjoyment al
 ike. He has also performed in a variety of Colorado-based music groups acro
 ss the nation. The crossroads of these experiences culminated in a special
 project\, Rooted Loops\, in which Devon performs live music while simultane
 ously painting a piece from start to finish.</p>
