DESCRIPTION:Summer Art Exploration: A Creative Journey with Diverse Art Too
 ls \n\nDive into a summer of creativity\, exploring various art tools\, tec
 hniques\, and activities that inspire joy and hope through art. \n\nClass D
 escription: This camp is designed for young artists to experience a wide ra
 nge of art tools and techniques\, including watercolor\, pastel\, crayons\,
  watercolor brush pens\, watercolor pencils\, origami\, hanji crafts\, and
 drawing. Alongside hands-on projects\, children will engage in art games an
 d field trips that encourage creative expression and joyful learning. Our g
 oal is to foster a sense of joy and hope through artistic exploration. \n\n
  Class Fee$450 \n Materials Fee: None (all materials provided by the instru
 ctor) \nAge Range: 8-12 years \nClass Size: Minimum 1 student\, maximum 6 s
 tudents \nSkill Level: All levels are welcome (projects are adaptable for d
 ifferent skill levels) \n\nThis camp offers an immersive\, interactive art
 experience that will inspire young students to explore\, create\, and conne
 ct with art in a fun and supportive environment.
