DESCRIPTION:<h1><strong>4TH WED- 6PM-8PM</strong></h1><h1><a href="https://
 www.eventbrite.com/e/play-with-clay-night-jan-2024-tickets-726752595577"><s
 trong>PLAY WITH CLAY JAN</strong></a><br></h1><br><p><b>Who:</b> Anyone int
 erested in hand-building ceramics</p><p><b>When:</b> 4th Wednesday of the M
 onth</p><p><b>Where:</b> Firehouse Art Center Ceramics Studio (Upstairs)- 6
 67 4th Ave Longmont\, CO</p><p>Join us for a casual gathering to play with
 clay and meet fellow clay lovers. Open to folks of all levels\, demos will
 be shown for construction for beginners or just come and do your own thing!
  Only 15 dollars and the class covers your clay and for your pieces to get
 bisque fired. You can then pick up your fired work to paint at home or brin
 g to our next Play with Clay night to glaze the work. Handbuilding projects
  only.</p>
