DESCRIPTION:<h1>Drawing Free</h1><br><a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/
 drawing-free-tickets-617952832557">https://www.eventbrite.com/e/drawing-fre
 e-tickets-617952832557</a><p><strong>Unleash your inner ability to draw wha
 t you see in person and your mind with mindful techniques that take you bey
 ond the rules of drawing.</strong></p><section><br><br>By <strong>Sara L. B
 roers Brown</strong><br><span>Unleash your inner ability to draw what you s
 ee in person and in your mind with mindful techniques that take you beyond
 the academic rules of drawing. Drawing is the base for all art mediums. Whe
 ther your sketching ideas for a ceramic sculpture or painting plein-air\, t
 he first step is getting what you envision or see before you recreated with
  your chosen media. Exploring mindful techniques will free your drawing ski
 lls beyond the straight line and enhance your visionary skill. This worksho
 p will be filled with life drawing exploration. Supplies will be provided.
 However\, if you have favorite pencils\, black felt or drawing pens\, or wo
 rking sketchbook 9"X11" or larger\, bring it. beginners and professionals a
 re welcome. Suggested age is 14 -90. Independent budding young artists are
 accepted.</span></section>
LAST-MODIFIED:20230427T003452Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Drawing Free With Sara Broers Brown
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
