DESCRIPTION:<p>The Dia de los Muertos Family Fiesta and the Catrina Ball wi
 ll be here soon!</p><p><span>Join Meow Wolf at the Firehouse and make marig
 old and butterfly masks and headpieces to get you ready for the ball!</span
 ></p><p><span>Kate Major\, professional costume and creature maker at Denve
 r’s Convergence Station\, will be inside the Firehouse&#39\;s Main and Sout
 h Gallery for an adult only building workshop. Come make a mask or headpiec
 e to wear to the Gigantes Procession on October 14th. </span></p><p><span>M
 aterials will include recylced items\, flowers\, and paper mache. These wil
 l be privided along with c</span><span>ardboard\, bubble wrap\, packing mat
 erials\, yarn\, pipe cleaners\, paint and glue. We encourage you to bring y
 our own materials to build with too! Please leave glass\, sharp metal\, any
 thing dirty\, wet\, icky or gross at home\, though.</span></p><p>Tickets ar
 e $7 per person and this session is for adults over 21.<br></p>
