DESCRIPTION:<span>Let’s Draw! Have you ever wanted to be able to draw a flo
 wer on a hike or draw a portrait of your best friend or dog? Maybe you just
  want a fun way to spark your creative mind and drawing skills. Join local
 artist Sara L. Broers Brown and explore the magic of mindful-based drawing
 which is the foundation for 2-D and 3-D art as well as design. All levels o
 f drawing enthusiasts are invited from beginners to professionals. Let’s ge
 t ready to draw! Each class will vary with warm-ups\, themes\, and material
 s. Participants are encouraged to bring their own sketchbook\, pencil and f
 elt pen. Basic materials will be provided as well as media specific to the
 workshop such as pastels and paints. Sign up by 12 pm the Tuesday before.  
 </span><br>$60 per  2 hour workshop  <br>Thursday\, January 19\, 6-8 pm - <
 a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.eventbrite.com/e/lets-draw
 -tickets-499934677077&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;ust=1673110274958
 358&amp\;usg=AOvVaw2AqfiyJVpVuYZpY0dE5nad" target="_blank">https://www.even
 tbrite.com/e/<u></u>lets-draw-tickets-499934677077</a><br>Wednesday January
  25\, 12-2 pm- <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.eventbrite
 .com/e/lets-draw-tickets-499948578657&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;u
 st=1673110274958358&amp\;usg=AOvVaw2qqnKRdRrehOznrnsI0b5S" target="_blank">
 https://www.eventbrite.com/e/lets-draw-tickets-499948578657</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20230102T165136Z
