DESCRIPTION:<section><header><h2><strong style="">For tickets:</strong></h2
 ><h2><a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/life-drawing-with-art-of-modelin
 g-long-sit-tickets-139320927645" style="font-size: 14px\;" id="ow948" __is_
 owner="true">Life Drawing with Art of Modeling- LONG SIT Tickets\, Fri\, Ju
 n 4\, 2021 at 5:00 PM | Eventbrite</a><br></h2></header><br><br><br><br><br
 ><p>Friday\, June 4th- 5pm-8pm: Model- Gianna</p><p>(See separate event for
  shorter seated and standing poses)</p><p>The Firehouse Art Center presents
  a socially distanced figure drawing session. 18+.</p><p>About this Event</
 p><p>The Firehouse is proud to offer a socially distanced life drawing sess
 ion coordinated with Art of Modeling.</p><p>Long Sit- Wet media allowed but
  artists MUST clean up their area afterwards. 3D materials must provide fur
 ther protective materials (tarps\, etc.) and must email host before class.<
 /p><p>The Firehouse provides chairs and tables\, BYO easel and supplies.</p
 ><p>In this three-hour session poses start with a few short warmups leading
  into one longer seated pose. This isan open-studio format. This is not an
 instructor-led class: artists are invited to practice their craft in their
 own style.</p><p>All artists are responsible for cleaning their area after
 class. For distancing reasons\, each person will need a separate table or m
 ust bring their own easel. No materials will be provided or shared. Space i
 s LIMITED.</p><p>Discount pricing for Firehouse Artist members\, space is l
 imited. Doors close 5 minutes after class start and open 15 minutes before.
 </p></section>
LAST-MODIFIED:20210203T162839Z
