 ckets-824934038917?aff=oddtdtcreator">https://www.eventbrite.com/e/kinetic-
 sculptures-101-tickets-824934038917</a><br>GA-$30<br>Parent/child ticket- m
 ake 1 sculpture- $40<br><p>Unleash your creativity in our hands-on course f
 ocused on crafting small kinetic sculptures! Dive into the world of movemen
 t and artistry as you learn the fundamentals of designing and constructing
 captivating sculptures that come to life through motion. Explore various ma
 terials\, mechanisms\, and techniques to bring your ideas into motion\, cre
 ating mesmerizing and dynamic pieces. Join us and discover the magic of scu
 lpting in motion!</p><p>If you have a power drill\, please bring to the cla
 ss. We will have some to share\, but having your own makes the project go s
 moother.</p><p>You need to be able to control and use power tools during th
 is class.</p>
