DESCRIPTION:<br><h4>ONLINE EVENT-&nbsp\;<a href="https://firehouseart.org/v
 irtual-market-series/">https://firehouseart.org/virtual-market-series/</a><
 /h4><h4>Join us in supporting Longmont’s creative community at the ArtWalk
 Strongmont Virtual Artist Market series. Going beyond a typical online shop
 \, this dynamic and interactive portal is an invitation into each artist’s
 studio to watch them create art LIVE! Virtually visit each artist\, watch t
 hem create\, and purchase from their online shop\, all from the comfort and
  safety of your home. Please select any artist’s profiles below for a link
 to their livestream and enjoy!</h4><p><strong>Hosted by Amanda Maldonado (@
 coy.ink) in partnership with ArtWalk Longmont\, The Firehouse Art Center\,
 and&nbsp\;<a href="https://downtownlongmont.com/">Downtown Longmont</a>\, t
 his virtual market was created to show how #Strongmont creates! A Community
  based Virtual Market\, 15% of all sales will be donated to The Firehouse A
 rt Center\, an organization committed to bringing art and culture to the Lo
 ngmont community regardless of race\, gender and socioeconomic status.&nbsp
 \;<a href="https://firehouseart.org/virtual-market-series/#abtAmanda">Read
 more</a>&nbsp\;about our host and organizer\, Amanda Maldonado.</strong></p
 ><p>Open to artists of all types\, crafters\, performers\, makers. If you h
 ave any questions\, please contact Amanda Maldonado (amlineberry@gmail.com)
 . Thank you for your interest in our virtual market!</p><p><strong>The time
 s listed below are MST\, although Vendors and Artists must be from Colorado
 \, the market is open for shopping across the world.<br></strong></p><br><b
 r><h3><a href="https://firehouseart.org/virtual-market-series/#0620">JUNE 2
 0TH\, 11AM-2PM</a>&nbsp\;|&nbsp\;<a href="https://firehouseart.org/virtual-
 market-series/#0718">JULY 18TH\, 11AM-2PM</a>&nbsp\;|&nbsp\;<a href="https:
 //firehouseart.org/virtual-market-series/#0822" id="ow1710" __is_owner="tru
 e">AUGUST 22ND\, 11AM-2PM</a></h3>
