DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/firehouse-makes-a-movie-t
 ickets-741268031637?aff=ebdsoporgprofile">https://www.eventbrite.com/e/fire
 house-makes-a-movie-tickets-741268031637</a><br><span><br></span><br><span>
 Get artsy with film! Color\, paint\, and make a short movie. Supplies provi
 ded.</span><br><br>You\, the members of Firehouse\, are invited to an eveni
 ng of relaxing creative playtime as we practice the tactile methods of expe
 rimental cinema. In other words\, you're invited to color on 16mm film usin
 g the supplies that Allison will provide. As you are coloring and painting\
 , your host\, Allison\, will document the experience on Super 8 film. At th
 e end of the night\, Allison will get all of the footage digitized and edit
  it together so that you can see the fruits of your artistic play come toge
 ther into a finished short film.<br>We'll begin the night with a brief scre
 ening of a few short films by Stan Brakhage\, one of most important names i
 n experimental cinema who also happened to call Boulder\, Colorado his home
  for much of his career. After this inspiration\, Allison will give you a q
 uick tutorial in basic practices for painting on and distorting your film.
 Then\, you can spend the rest of the evening going bonkers on your section
 of film.<br><br>Never heard of Stan Brakhage? Never made a movie\, or even
 picked up a paintbrush? That's okay! Playing with the medium and learning a
 bout it as you create is what experimental cinema is all about.<br><br>Fina
 lly\, just a note for all participants: You will be supplied with paint\, n
 ail polish\, markers\, and sculpting tools which you can use to color\, scr
 atch\, and distort your film. Allison will provide gloves. Just to be on th
 e extra safe side\, I recommend wearing casual clothes that can withstand t
 he chance of paint splatter.
LAST-MODIFIED:20231106T225214Z
LOCATION:Firehouse Art Center\, 667 4th Avenue\, Longmont\, CO 80501
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Firehouse Makes A Movie
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
