DESCRIPTION:<p>Join us to learn about this historical printmaking process a
 nd hear how artists are using stone lithography today. Gregory Santos will
 demonstrate\, using a one-of-a-kind traveling press.</p><p>Originally from
 New York\, Gregory Santos is the printmaking director at Art Gym Denver\, a
 nd has been involved with Month of Printmaking since 2016 as a volunteer an
 d chair - coordinating events\, securing sponsorship\, and supporting print
 makers from around the Front Range.</p><p>This demonstration accompanies ou
 r exhibit featuring all 24 prints from his national exchange project\, Mixe
 d Grit. For more information about Santos and the Mixed Grit project\, visi
 t: gregorysantos.com</p><br>For more information and full schedule of Month
  of Printmaking events\, visit moprint.org<br><br>6pm- Sold Out<br>7pm-&nbs
 p\;<a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/lithography-demo-with-greg-santos-
 tickets-293556945727"><u>https://www.eventbrite.com/e/lithography-demo-with
 -greg-santos-tickets-293556945727<br></u></a>
