UID:410bqork635f0d6og8idha99ua@google.com
CREATED:20210430T002552Z
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://bmoca.org/calendar/view/special-event/pandemic
 -heroes-and-for-myself" id="ow502" __is_owner="true">"Pandemic Heroes" and
 "For Myself" – Special Event – Calendar – BMoCA – Boulder Museum of Contemp
 orary Art</a><br><p>Join us for an exhibition by the 2021 Studio Project In
 terns! Themes of this exhibition include exploring issues of responsibility
  and heroism during the pandemic &amp\; self care and body positivity.</p><
 p><strong>Artists in Residence</strong><br>Austin Zucchini Fowler\, Sofie B
 irkin\, and Elaine Waterman</p><p><strong>Exhibiting Artists</strong><br>Cl
 ara Linder\, Jordan Stroebel\, Lilia Alizadeh\, Luana Cooper\, and Lucy Mur
 dock</p><p>The long-running Studio Project program provides purposeful enga
 gement for high school aged youth. This program is targeted to serve youth
 with opportunities to create dialogue about art\, art making\, and social i
 ssues as they affect young people. The 2021 studio project is a collaborati
 on between BMoCA &amp\; the&nbsp\;<a href="https://firehouseart.org/">Fireh
 ouse Art Center</a>.</p><p>Masks are required\, and social distancing will
 be observed.</p><p><em>Special thanks to the Georgie Fund for its support o
 f the Studio Project program and to Center Copy Printing &amp\; Pro Copy.</
 em></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20210430T002552Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Studio Project Internship Exhibit at BMoCA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
