UID:5kgevia0fdg142h7c7uqv3k7hf@google.com
CREATED:20211101T155758Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>Afterschool Clay Creations<br></p><p>Dates: November 10th\,
 17th and December 1st (no class Thanksgiving break)</p><p>Ages: 7 and up</p
 ><p>Times: 4:30 to 6pm</p><p>Prices: $55 for all 3 classes</p><p>During the
  class we will explore various clay techniques and finishes. With a focus o
 n hand building. Kids will create art through both teacher-guided and self-
 guided experiences. In addition\, students will have opportunities during t
 he class for creative expression through decorating and painting themed act
 ivities.</p><p>The first week we will make our own beads to make either a n
 ecklace\, keychain or window hanger. Then using a pinch pot method and the
 slab roller we will create a spoon rest (perfect for gifting)!</p><p>In the
  second class we will finish up spoon rest and begin painting the beads and
  planning out our accessory. The last class we will talk about color and ho
 w through various color combinations it can change the feeling our projects
  can give us.</p><p>All projects will be ready for pick up the week followi
 ng.</p><p>Sign up here: https://adragonflyandacrow.com or here https://adra
 gonflyandacrow.com/kids-classes.</p><p></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20221220T180714Z
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Afterschool Clay Creations
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
