DESCRIPTION:"For the love of the song" is a listening room style experience
  held at the historic Firehouse Art Center on Friday\, June 2nd\, 2023. The
  special songwriter focused showcase features three singer songwriters shar
 ing original songs in a song circle format. The evening will be held from 6
 pm - 8pm at Firehouse Art Center 667 4th Avenue in Longmont\,CO. \n\nThis m
 onth features Christopher Morse a Nashville Pop artist from Boulder\,CO\, I
 ndie Folk artist Ingrid Avison of Nederland\,CO and Folk Noir touring artis
 t Angel Corsi by way of Longmont\,CO. The trio will share their original so
 ngs on identity\, growth\, and grief and even coming together to support ea
 ch other in their performance. \n\nFree to the public and donations to the
 Firehouse Art Center as well\, as the artists are highly encouraged. A List
 ening Room style show requires a attentive audience\, you will be asked to
 quiet down if there is excessive talking during performances\, think of thi
 s like going to the cinema and talking through the "movie"\, we want to cul
 tivate a listening room culture throughout the performances with meet and g
 reets and social time before and after the show. Wine and Fingerfood provid
 ed by the Firehouse Art Center.
LAST-MODIFIED:20230310T151524Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Firehouse Listening Room- For the Love of Song
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
