DESCRIPTION:Please join me at ArtWalk Summer on the Streets!<br><br>This we
 ekend in our Kids Activity Weekend!  We will have kids art activities pre-p
 ackaged into easy to pick up kits!  <br><br>(no shared art supplies\, socia
 lly distanced\, responsible and creative!)<br>Contributing artists to the k
