DESCRIPTION:<br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br
 ><br><h1><strong>4TH WED- 6PM-8PM</strong></h1><h1><a href="https://www.eve
 ntbrite.com/e/play-with-clay-night-oct-2023-tickets-726746166347"><strong>P
 LAY WITH CLAY OCTOBER</strong></a></h1><br><br><h1><a href="https://www.eve
 ntbrite.com/e/play-with-clay-night-jan-2024-tickets-726752595577"><strong>P
 LAY WITH CLAY JAN</strong></a></h1><br><br><p>(WE ARE TAKING A BREAK FROM P
 LAY WITH CLAY FOR THE HOLIDAYS IN NOV AND DEC)</p><p>Who: Anyone interested
  in handbuilding ceramics</p><br><br><p>When- 4th Wednesday of the Month</p
 ><p>Where: Firehouse Art Center Ceramics Studio (Upstairs)- 667 4th Ave Lon
 gmont\, CO</p><p>Join us for a casual gathering to play with clay and meet
 fellow clay lovers. Open to folks of all levels\, demos will be shown for c
 onstruction for beginners or just come and do your own thing! Only 15 dolla
 rs and the class covers your clay and for your pieces to get bisque fired.
 You can then pick up your fired work to paint at home or bring to our next
 Play with Clay night to glaze the work. Handbuilding projects only.</p>
