CREATED:20220125T014947Z
DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><u></u><b>Pine Needle Basket Weaving</b><br>April 9
 - noon to 3 p.m.<br><br>Use pine needles and waxed linen to weave together
 baskets using our step-by-step instructions/demonstration. Rachel Courtney
 and Dana Steiner will lead the class. All materials will be provided and th
 e class is $40 at Firehouse Art Center\, 667 4th Avenue\, Longmont\, CO 805
 01. RSVP at&nbsp\;<a href="http://prettynicecreations.com/event">prettynice
 creations.com/event</a>&nbsp\;to save your seat.<br><br><u></u><b><br></b><
 u></u><br><u></u><b>Bio</b><br>Rachel Courtney has been interested in desig
 ning and creating art from a young age. She has been making hand-made jewel
 ry\, blankets and scarves for decades and recently started painting. She st
 arted crocheting in 2000 and has been making blankets for Project Linus eve
 r since. She launched her Etsy store for Pretty Nice Creations in 2010 and
 has grown her online selling from scarves and blankets to a wide variety of
  crafts and graphic design work. She enjoys giving crafting classes – alcoh
 ol ink\, jewelry making\, painting and more.<br><br>Rachel received a bache
 lor’s degree in journalism and mass communications in 2003 and a certificat
 e in digital graphics technology in 2004. Her love of the simple beauties i
 n life led to the founding of her graphic design company\, Pretty Nice Crea
 tions where she can share her designs with the world. Beyond her graphics a
 nd textile work\, Rachel is an accomplished photographer and marketing expe
 rt who helps local businesses grow their reach online and off.<u></u></html
 -blob>
LAST-MODIFIED:20220404T180454Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Pine Needle Basket Weaving with Rachel- Studio 64
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20190909
