 om/o/kate-robare-an-artist-at-firehouse-art-center-37105844363" id="ow1467"
  __is_owner="true">Kate Robare an artist at Firehouse Art Center Events | E
 ventbrite</a><br><br>We will be creating 1 to 3 Gnomes decked out for St. P
 atty’s Day. Complete with a pot of gold! Parents are welcome to attend and
 make it a parent/child class or let the kids have some fun while you get so
 me alone time. Aprons are available but please send your child in clothes t
 hat can get messy. Per Boulder County guidelines masks are required no matt
 er vaccination status.
