DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><u></u><h1><strong style="font-size: 14px\;">MARCH 3
 \, 10\, 17\, 24</strong><br></h1><h1><p><a href="https://www.eventbrite.com
 /e/tweenteen-drawing-class-ages-10-15-thursdays-at-415-tickets-264558580837
 "><strong>SIGN UP- $44 first child\, $35 second child</strong></a><br><stro
 ng>4 WEEK SESSION</strong></p><p><span>Designed for ages 10-15\, teen class
 es encourage young artists to experiment and develop their own personal sty
 le.</span></p><p><span>This weekly 75-minute class is for students who Want
  to learn drawing skills as a foundation for other arts. We will have a dif
 ferent project each week.</span></p><p><span>Week 1- Still life and drawing
  from observation<br>Week 2- White and Color on black paper<br>Week 3- Grid
  drawings<br>Week 4- Personal style drawings- bring sketchbooks!</span></p>
 <p><span>Projects will include working with still life\, breaking down a ph
 otograph\, portrait work\, developing illustration skills and more. All sup
 plies are included and will vary within projects. Supplies may include past
 el\, marker\, colored pencil\, ink and charcoal pencils.&nbsp\;Please bring
  any samples you may have of past student work on the first day so class so
  that the instructor may gauge the student's learning level\, and discuss p
 ossible projects and goals with the student. </span></p><p><span>- Kids sho
 uld be able to work independently</span></p></h1><u></u></html-blob>
LAST-MODIFIED:20220322T204735Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:In Person Tween/Teen Drawing Class- Ages 10-15- Thursdays at 4:15-
 5:30- Studio 64
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
