DESCRIPTION:LadyBug Hinged Box: Sculpting Functional Art in Clay- sign up h
 ere- <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.hisawyer.com/firehou
 se-art-center-1/schedules/activity-set/1257102&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calend
 ar&amp\;ust=1739212461821189&amp\;usg=AOvVaw1Wh4E1ppCk_yYd7sbjYw9E" target=
 "_blank">Firehouse Art Center - LadyBug Hinged Box: Sculpting Functional Ar
 t in Clay</a><br><br>Description: 2 Hour Workshop<br><br>Discover the fasci
 nating world of functional ceramic art in this hands-on workshop! You’ll le
 arn to create a unique hinged box in the shape of a bug\, where the wings o
 pen and close like a lid. This workshop will guide you through the process
 of sculpting a bug-inspired design\, making and attaching hinges\, and ensu
 ring your piece is both functional and decorative. Whether you’re a beginne
 r or an experienced clay artist\, this class offers the perfect opportunity
  to explore new techniques and unleash your creativity.<br><br><br>What You
 ’ll Learn:<br><br>How to sculpt a bug form with clay.<br><br>The fundamenta
 ls of creating hinges for movable wings.<br><br>Tips and tricks for designi
 ng functional ceramic pieces. <br><br><br>Age Range: 8 +<br><br># of Studen
 ts: 6 to 12<br><br>Skill Level: Suitable for all levels.<br><br>Fee: $55<br
 ><br><br>Materials Provided: Yes and some tools needed*<br><br>Clay - rocky
  Mountain Dover<br><br>Kemper High Temp Wire 17 Gauge - For hinges<br><br>U
 nderglazes<br><br>Tiny Magnets Black Round - To keep wings closed<br><br>Bi
 sque Firing Included<br><br>Material needed: Round Nose Pliers and flat Nos
 e Pliers to make the hinges* <br><br><br>By the end of the workshop\, you’l
 l take home a one-of-a-kind bug box that opens to reveal a hidden compartme
 nt—perfect for storing small treasures or as a decorative keepsake.
LAST-MODIFIED:20250205T183428Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:LadyBug Hinged Box: Sculpting Functional Art in Clay
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
