UID:36pikklkua6vpk3c8ught5h98p@google.com
CREATED:20230718T183115Z
DESCRIPTION:<strong>SIGN UP HERE: </strong><a href="https://www.eventbrite.
 com/e/musical-canvas-firehouse-art-center-tickets-689691404557">Musical Can
 vas @ Firehouse Art Center Tickets\, Wed\, Sep 13\, 2023 at 6:00 PM | Event
 brite</a> <br><br> <strong>Musical Canvas combines art\, music\, and collab
 oration for a unique and memorable evening. Come express yourself through p
 ainting!</strong><br><strong><br></strong><p><strong><b>Hosted by Devon Tre
 e</b></strong> (<em><a href="http://devontreeart.com">devontreeart.com</a><
 /em>) - Devon Lindsay\, also known as “Tree”\, had his nickname given to hi
 m by his uncle to reflect his Native American heritage\, strong physical st
 ature\, and his deep spiritual roots. Devon has been painting since 2009 an
 d fell in love with live painting at events shortly after. He uses a variet
 y of different mediums including acrylic spray paint\, and airbrush.</p><p>
 With his variety of styles ranging from mountain landscapes to far-out psyc
 hedelic abstract paintings\, Devon took on the challenge of creating origin
 al paintings from start to finish during live music shows for the band and
 concertgoers' enjoyment alike. He has also performed in a variety of Colora
 do-based music groups across the nation. The crossroads of these experience
 s culminated in a special project\, Rooted Loops\, in which Devon performs
 live music while simultaneously painting a piece from start to finish.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20230803T010344Z
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Musical Canvas
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
