  as well as the instructions on how to cure the ink so it won't wash off.</
 p><p>Suggested ideas on what to paint will be provided\, but feel free to p
 aint whatever inspires you or bring your own photos to work from.</p><p>F﻿o
 od will not be provided\, feel free to bring your own food/drinks. Wine &am
 p\; coffee will be available for purchase through Firehouse Art Center</p><
