DESCRIPTION:Come enjoy a day that will make you feel good inside and out!<b
 r>Learn more here- <a href="https://events.humanitix.com/longmont-loves-com
 munity-activation-through-art-and-creativity">Longmont Loves: Community Act
 ivation through Art and Creativity</a><br><br>The holidays are coming up an
 d we will be collecting food items for Longmont Food Rescue. 1 food item me
 ans you can get 5 clothing items from the clothing swap\, 2 food items equa
 ls 10 clothing items!  Foods wish list here: <a href="https://a.co/5OH2g2b"
 >https://a.co/5OH2g2b</a> <br><br>There will be a  runway to model your new
  finds. Our Winter Artist in Residence\, Kenzie Sitterud\, will be recordin
 g the sound of your footsteps for a sound interactive to be used in their F
 ebruary Exhibit!<br><br>Disco Witch will be DJ’ing\,  and we will have art
 activities as well!<br><br>$10 printed totes- from 2pm-4pm<br>$10 clay turk
 ey- from 12pm-1pm (only 10 spots available- sign up here).<a href="https://
 events.humanitix.com/make-a-pinchpot-clay-turkey">https://events.humanitix.
 com/make-a-pinchpot-clay-turkey</a><br><br>Longmont Loves is our way to act
 ivate our community through art and creativity in a way that helps those in
  need. We hope you’ll be a part of it!
