DESCRIPTION:<h1><strong>SATURDAY ART EXPERIENCE WITH AMY- MIXED MEDIA MADNE
 SS!</strong></h1><p><a href="https://firehouseart.org/shop/"><strong>PURCHA
 SE TICKETS HERE</strong></a></p><p><a href="https://docs.google.com/documen
 t/d/1kr-9O-QayrXf5KMmgPJfvSFe4keNcII5/edit?usp=sharing&amp\;ouid=1022181586
 47752059443&amp\;rtpof=true&amp\;sd=true" class="pastedDriveLink-0">PRINT T
 HE PARENT PERMISSION FORM HERE AND BRING TO CLASS</a></p><p><strong>SATURDA
 YS: 10AM-12PM<br></strong><strong>Ages 7-13 (</strong>Kids under 7 can atte
 nd with a parent for $8)<br><strong>Cost: $8 (REDUCED LUNCH OR CHILDREN OF
 FAMILY PATRON OF THE ARTS CAN ATTEND FOR FREE)<br></strong><strong>Where:</
 strong> Firehouse Classroom (Entrance is on Coffman Street- go through the
 door and directly up the stairs to your right)</p><p><strong>PLEASE WEAR CL
 OTHING YOU DON’T MIND GETTING MESSY (coats can go on the hangers to the lef
 t of the Coffman entrance in the hallway)</strong></p><p>Click here to lear
 n about other benefits of <a href="https://firehouseart.org/membership/">be
 ing a Patron of the Arts!</a></p><p><strong>WHAT IS MIXED MEDIA? </strong><
 /p><p>In visual art\, mixed media describes artwork in which more than one 
 medium or material has been employed. Assemblages\, collages\, and sculptur
 e are three common examples of art using different media. </p><p>Mixed medi
 a art is distinguished from multimedia art which combines visual art with n
 on-visual elements\, such as recorded sound\, literature\, drama\, dance\,
 motion graphics\, music\, or interactivity. </p><p><b><i>Mixed media materi
 als </i></b><b><i>(can include\, not limited to) </i></b></p><ul><li><b>pai
 nt </b></li><li><b>cloth </b></li><li><b>paper </b></li><li><b>wood </b></l
 i><li><b>and found objects</b></li></ul>
LAST-MODIFIED:20241121T231449Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Saturday Art Experience Class for Kids
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
