UID:3vagn4kq8cs7rekiq6aroe5g5d@google.com
CREATED:20250205T183254Z
DESCRIPTION:Sgraffito Workshop with Ana- <a href="https://www.google.com/ur
 l?q=https://www.hisawyer.com/firehouse-art-center-1/schedules/activity-set/
 1257106&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;ust=1739212366342736&amp\;usg=A
 OvVaw3elhlZoDuLZfRksC7Yw3Wb" target="_blank">Firehouse Art Center - Sgraffi
 to Workshop with Ana Balzan</a><br><br>Immerse yourself in the art of sgraf
 fito<br><br>This relaxing and creative workshop is designed for adults to e
 xplore this ancient ceramic decoration technique. <br><br><br>What You’ll L
 earn:<br><br>Sgraffito Basics: Uncover the magic of sgraffito\, a technique
  where layers of colored slip are scratched away to reveal the contrasting
 clay beneath. Whether you want to create your own unique design or use one
 of the provided templates\, you’ll learn to craft detailed patterns and tex
 tures with ease.<br><br><br>Practical Application: Gain hands-on experience
  decorating a pre-colored ceramic plate coated with black underglaze\, read
 y for sgraffito work.<br><br><br>Who Should Attend: This workshop is perfec
 t for adults who have an interest in ceramics and want to try a fun\, decor
 ative technique. No prior experience is necessary\, so come with your creat
 ivity and a desire to learn!<br><br><br>Materials Provided - All materials
 are included\, such as:<br><br>• Pre-colored leather hard ceramic plates wi
 th black underglaze<br><br>• Sgraffito tools<br><br>• Bisque firing of your
  finished piece<br><br><br>Duration: 3 hours<br><br>Price:$55<br><br>Min- 4
 <br><br>Max- 8<br><br><br>Join us for an inspiring and enjoyable evening of
  creativity and connection. Your finished plate will be a testament to your
  artistic journey—and a wonderful keepsake to cherish!<br><br><br>Note: The
  pieces will need to be fired once they are completely dry\, which may take
  up to 2 weeks. I will send a collective email to notify everyone when thei
 r pieces are ready for pickup. If you would like your piece glazed\, there
 is a $10 extra from price. This covers clear glaze and firing.
LAST-MODIFIED:20250205T183254Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Sgraffito Workshop
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
