CREATED:20211223T195813Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>What: Play with Clay Night </p><p>Who: Anyone interested in
 handbuilding ceramics</p><p>Sign up here: <a href="https://www.eventbrite.c
 om/e/play-with-clay-night-july-2023-tickets-643886811787">https://www.event
 brite.com/e/play-with-clay-night-july-2023-tickets-643886811787</a></p><p>W
 here: Firehouse Art Center Ceramics Studio (Upstairs)- 667 4th Ave Longmont
 \, CO</p><p>Join us for a casual gathering to play with clay and meet fello
 w clay lovers. Open to folks of all levels\, demos will be shown for constr
 uction for beginners or just come and do your own thing! Only 12 dollars an
 d the class covers your clay and for your pieces to get bisque fired. You c
 an then pick up your fired work to paint at home or bring to our next Play
 with Clay night to glaze the work. Handbuilding projects only. </p>
