X-GOOGLE-CONFERENCE:https://meet.google.com/qbx-gyzz-yob
CREATED:20200822T043838Z
DESCRIPTION:<br>https://www.eventbrite.com/e/catrina-painting-days-tickets-
 117470855491<br><br><br>Come paint a Catrina painting for our Dia de los Mu
 ertos exhibit opening at the Firehouse Art Center!<br><br><p></p><p>The nam
 e\, Catrina Ball\, refers to the Calavera Catrina – a 1910–1913 zinc etchin
 g by the Mexican printmaker\, cartoon illustrator and lithographer José Gua
 dalupe Posada. She is offered as a satirical portrait of those Mexican nati
 ves who\, Posada felt\, were aspiring to adopt European aristocratic tradit
 ions in the pre-revolution era. La Catrina has become an icon of the Mexica
 n Día de los Muertos\, or Day of the Dead.</p><p></p><p>All ages are invite
 d to join us in celebrating Dia de Los Muertos with community painting of C
 atrina's for our South Gallery Exhibition and Dia de los Muertos Exhibit op
 ening! Painting will occur indoors and outdoors to increase the capacity an
 d we will be limiting attendance to keep with social distancing practices.<
 /p><p></p><p>We will be auctioning off the Catrinas at the Exhibit Opening!
  We hope that you will join us to create these works of art that support an
 d sustain the Firehouse Art Center\, while educating the community on this
 wonderful cultural event!</p><p></p><p>All materials for this activity are
 provided\, but a $5-10 donation would be much appreciated!</p>\n\nJoin with
  Google Meet: https://meet.google.com/qbx-gyzz-yob\nOr dial: (US) +1 419-76
 8-8719 PIN: 909321131#\nMore phone numbers: https://tel.meet/qbx-gyzz-yob?p
 in=6842360134395&hs=7\n\nLearn more about Meet at: https://support.google.c
 om/a/users/answer/9282720
LAST-MODIFIED:20200822T043838Z
LOCATION:Firehouse Art Center\, 667 4th Avenue\, Longmont\, CO\, US\, 80501
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Catrina Painting Days
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
