DESCRIPTION:<h1><strong>4TH WED- 6PM-8PM</strong></h1><h1><strong><a href="
 https://events.humanitix.com/play-with-clay-september">PLAY WITH CLAY</a></
 strong><br></h1><br><p><b>Who:</b> Anyone interested in hand-building ceram
 ics</p><p><b>When:</b> 4th Wednesday of the Month</p><p><b>Where:</b> Fireh
 ouse Art Center Ceramics Studio (Upstairs)- 667 4th Ave Longmont\, CO</p><p
 >Join us for a casual gathering to play with clay and meet fellow clay love
 rs. Open to folks of all levels\, demos will be shown for construction for
 beginners or just come and do your own thing! Only 15 dollars and the class
  covers your clay and for your pieces to get bisque fired. You can then pic
 k up your fired work to paint at home or bring to our next Play with Clay n
 ight to glaze the work. Handbuilding projects only.</p>
