DESCRIPTION:<p>Block print basics and alternative ways to use them:</p><p>J
 oin local maker Grace Gutierrez for a block printmaking workshop! Carve you
 r very own rubber stamp or multiple stamps from a 4x6” rubber block\, and e
 xperiment with materials and methods of stamping on a variety of stampable
 items! Use your stamps to create a classic paper print\, ceramic ornaments
 or slabs\, cloth swatches and a glitter print.</p><p>Sign up here- <a href=
 "https://www.eventbrite.com/e/block-print-basics-and-alternative-ways-to-us
 e-them-tickets-793850888377?aff=oddtdtcreator">Block print basics and alter
 native ways to use them Tickets\, Sat\, Mar 16\, 2024 at 11:00 AM | Eventbr
 ite</a></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20240116T165140Z
