DESCRIPTION:\nSchool's OUT!!! Come shop Downtown Longmont and support local
  small businesses. Drop off the kiddos from 12pm-3pm Friday and Saturday fo
 r art making fun for just $5 while you shop the Holiday Market at the Fireh
 ouse or enjoy downtown shopping!\n\nWe'll have hot cocoa and clay ornament
 painting for the kiddos (and the young at heart) to express their creativit
 y. This will be open house style\, so feel free to come whenever you can fr
 om 12pm-3pm. Stay as long as you'd like and learn more about the awesome wo
 rk being done by The Firehouse Art Center\, or head on out and get a little
  shopping done.\n\nJust in time for the holidays\, you can make your own or
 naments and gift tags in clay! Items will be fired and will be ready for pi
 ck up on December 24th from 12pm-3pm. Or decorate pre-fired ornaments with
 acrylic markers and take with you after the event.
LAST-MODIFIED:20231212T160549Z
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Ornament Painting and Holiday Market at the Firehouse
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
