DESCRIPTION:<br><br><br><br><br><br><h3>ArtWalk is a cultural event series
 in Longmont for arts lovers and future arts lovers. We connect arts\, busin
 ess\, nonprofit\, and education to celebrate local creativity.</h3><br><br>
 <h4>ArtWalk is the Firehouse Art Center’s yearly Community Festival that br
 ings together local artists\, businesses and nonprofits. It is an event tha
 t highlights art\, economy and creating positive change in our communities.
  Held on the 2nd Saturday in September\, we shut down Main Street in Longmo
 nt and turn Downtown into a walking mall filled with art\, music\, activiti
 es and more!</h4><p>&nbsp\;</p><h4><em><strong>September ArtWalk returns on
  September 10th!</strong></em></h4><p>&nbsp\;</p><h4>Things to look foward
 to…</h4><ul><li><h4>Music Performances&nbsp\;throughout Downtown</h4></li><
 li><h4>Artist Booths and art activities throughout Downtown</h4></li><li><h
 4>Nonprofit and Business booths highlighting the best of what Longmont has
 to offer</h4></li><li><h4>Activities with Bicycle Longmont and Junkyard Soc
 ial</h4></li><li><h4>SVVSD performances- Band\, Choir\, Theater\, Symphony
 and more</h4></li><li><h4>The Dance Dimensions Stage\, featuring Dance perf
 ormances from Longmont’s premier dance companies</h4></li><li><h4>Food truc
 ks and Brewery Booths throughout Downtown</h4></li><li><h4>and so much more
 !</h4></li></ul><p>&nbsp\;</p><h4>If you are looking for Summer on the Stre
 ets\, our weekly Saturday Summer Mini Fest on Kimbark\, find more info&nbsp
 \;<a href="https://firehouseart.org/summeronthestreets">here</a>…</h4><h4><
 em><strong>Summer on the Streets\,&nbsp\;</strong></em>spread out over 8 we
 eks\, is our Saturday mini festival of pop up live music and art markets. I
 t will be located on Kimbark in front of the Longmont Public Library for 20
 22.</h4><h4><a href="https://firehouseart.org/summeronthestreets"><strong>V
 isit the Summer on the Streets page to see the weekly line up of artists an
 d musicians and to learn more about CHALKMONT\, our community chalk festiva
 l on August 27st!</strong></a></h4><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><fig
 ure><br></figure>
LAST-MODIFIED:20221220T180735Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:ARTWALK
TRANSP:OPAQUE
