DESCRIPTION:Join us to make your own 3D cardboard creature! Artist Amy Hoag
 land demonstrates her process from concept through the use of free design s
 oftware and the logistics of construction while our Curator Brandy Coons fo
 llows along and attempts the project. Hoagland is a CU Boulder MFA candidat
 e in Sculpture\, currently working in the Firehouse Art Center Winter Resid
 ency\, supported by NEST CU Boulder. The workshop will livestream on Fireho
 use Art Center's Facebook page\, free to all!\n\nFree templates available s
 oon (via eventbrite page)\, stay tuned for links!\n\nYou will need:\n\n-Car
 dboard - quarter inch thick will work best\n-Exacto Knife\, scissors\, or b
 ox cutter\n-Glue\n\nBrought to you by Firehouse Art Center: https://www.fir
 ehouseart.org\n\nand NEST Studio for the Arts: https://www.colorado.edu/nes
 t/\n\nhttps://www.eventbrite.com/e/3d-cardboard-construction-with-amy-hoagl
 and-tickets-133008703613
