DESCRIPTION:This Summer\, the Firehouse Art Center is partnering with Downt
 own Longmont to fill the streets with art\, music and fun.  Spread out over
  8 weeks\, these mini weekend ArtWalks will offer artists an opportunity to
  share their art and music\, all the while supporting our local economy.  J
 oin us for over 18 Artist Booths and 6 musicians weekly in three Art Activa
 ted Spaces in the Breezeways and Alleys of Downtown!  What a perfect way to
  celebrate Summer on the Streets of Longmont!  Happening every Saturday fro
 m 4pm-8pm from July 3rd through August 21.<br><b><br></b><br><b>Check out t
 he weekly line up here- <a href="https://firehouseart.org/summeronthestreet
 s2021/">https://firehouseart.org/summeronthestreets2021/</a></b><br><br>Com
 e to the Firehouse for more info!
