DESCRIPTION:Thursday\, January 18th at Longmont Public Media from 6-8 PM. J
 oin us for a whirlwind evening of STOP MOTION MANIA! I'll bring the props a
 nd prompts\, and you bring the inspiration to make a stop-motion micro-shor
 t film come to life in just a few hours. Mark your calendars and join us!\n
 \nAlso\, our February meeting will happen on Tuesday\, February 13th at Fir
 ehouse Art Center from 6-8 PM. Our animation streak will continue with a fu
 n night of painting on 16mm film. For those of you who have always wanted t
 o dabble in direct animation (or\, if you just want a cool way to mingle wi
 th other local filmmakers)\, this night is for you! \n\nJoin with Google Me
 et: https://meet.google.com/jhd-chdx-uco\nOr dial: (US) +1 540-947-4755 PIN
 : 625218715#\nMore phone numbers: https://tel.meet/jhd-chdx-uco?pin=9894937
 122602&hs=7\n\nLearn more about Meet at: https://support.google.com/a/users
 /answer/9282720
