DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://firehouseart.org/special-events/monthly-events
 /">Monthly Events - Firehouse Art Center</a><br><br><p>Firehouse Filmmakers
  offers monthly meetups\, workshops\, and screening events for local filmma
 kers. We welcome filmmakers of all skill levels and artistic inclinations\,
  from experimental animators to commercial producers\, cinematographers to
 screenwriters\, seasoned professionals to casual dabblers. Even if you have
 n’t made a movie yet\, this group is here to help you get inspired.</p><p>O
 ur primary meet-up is First Tuesday Brews\, which happens on the first Tues
 day of the month at 300 Suns Brewing from 7:30-8:30 PM. This is a great opp
 ortunity to get to know other local filmmakers and film lovers. Come by\, e
 njoy something delicious\, and make some new friends. If you’re new to the
 group\, just look for Allison\, the organizer of Firehouse Filmmakers. She’
 s the woman in the bright pink Doc Martens. Come by and join us next month!
 </p><p>In addition to these meetups\, Firehouse Filmmakers organizes a vari
 ety of events and workshops. Past events include: direct animation workshop
 s\, a very special Camera Night featuring 16mm cameras provided by local ci
 nematographer Garrit Speiss\, and screenings of member-selected short films
 . We’ve also partnered with other awesome local organizations like WIFMCO a
 nd Longmont Public Media to host livestreams and gear-related events.</p><p
 >To learn more about Firehouse Filmmakers or to join the mailing list for t
 he Firehouse Filmmakers newsletter (which is full of updates about upcoming
  workshops and events)\, please email Allison at <a href="mailto:hello@sunn
 ypictures.co" target="_blank">hello@sunnypictures.co</a>. You can also foll
 ow <a href="https://www.instagram.com/firehouseartcenter/?hl=en" target="_b
 lank">Firehouse Art Center</a> and <a href="https://www.instagram.com/sunny
 pictures.co/" target="_blank">Sunny Pictures</a> on Instagram for regular u
 pdates.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260514T202815Z
LOCATION:300 Suns Brewing\, 335 1st Ave Unit C\, Longmont\, CO 80501\, USA
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Filmmakers meetup- 300 Suns
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
