BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20260614T190000Z
DTEND:20260614T210000Z
DTSTAMP:20261030T045920Z
UID:1r5o25rbq6pa7t7puobvpftdj3@google.com
CREATED:20260609T222227Z
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://www.facebook.com/events/1016897457572524">http
 s://www.facebook.com/events/1016897457572524</a><br><br>Join us for an arti
 st talk with Britni Mara as she takes us through her exhibition "The Reckon
 ing".<br>Gain a deeper understanding of her creative process and techniques
 . An artist walkthrough will occur after the talk.<br>About the exhibit and
  the artist<br>The Reckoning- Britni Mara<br>The Reckoning is Mara’s ongoin
 g personal and collective account of how systems imprint onto lived experie
 nce\, and how individuals navigate complacency\, resistance\, and vulnerabi
 lity within those systems.<br>Each mark reflects political fracture and emo
 tional spill\, both unresolved and uncontained. Gestures interrupt\, push b
 ack\, and resist absorption\, suggesting that even within overwhelming syst
 ems\, disruption and agency remain possible.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260609T222228Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Artist Talk with Mara
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
