CREATED:20190729T190449Z
DESCRIPTION:The Firehouse Art Center is Longmont’s leading contemporary art
  center featuring both national and local artists. Our beautiful National H
 istoric Landmark building features two exhibitions spaces and over 1\,000 s
 quare feet of space. In 2018 we exhibited 108 artists in 19 unique exhibiti
 ons. New exhibitions are installed almost every month. We focus on accessib
 le contemporary art that engages curiosity and conversation. Admission to t
 he Firehouse is free and serves over 7\,500 visitors each year. We were vot
 ed the Best Art Gallery in East Boulder County\, for 6 years in a row and t
 he Times Call Readers Choice for Best Art Gallery 5 years in a row.\n\nOur
 exhibitions committee consists of artists\, art administrators\, business p
 rofessionals\, curators and art collectors. Preference is given to submissi
 ons that are culturally relevant with a unique perspective and the ability
 to provide a diverse art experience. Cutting edge contemporary work and mul
 ti-disciplinary artists are strongly encouraged. Group exhibitions and cura
 torial proposals are welcomed\, as well as solo exhibition proposals from e
 stablished and emerging artists in all mediums.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260409T205932Z
LOCATION:https://www.callforentry.org/
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Open Call for Submissions
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
