DESCRIPTION:Sign up here- <a href="https://www.hisawyer.com/firehouse-art-c
 enter-1/schedules/activity-set/1914727">Firehouse Art Center - Beginner Cro
 chet</a><br><br><p>This class is perfect for total beginners wanting to get
  started on their crochet journey. No prior experience required.</p><p>You'
 ll learn how to hold the hook and yarn\, and complete basic crochet stitche
 s.</p><p>Each attendee will be given yarn\, hook\, stitch markers\, and han
 dout to keep.</p><p><b>Class fee:</b> $20 per person </p><p>$5 optional mat
 erials donation </p><p><b>Class requirements:</b></p><p>Ages &lt\;13 are in
 vited to request a private lesson or attend a free crochet guild meeting.</
 p><p>Ages 13-15 years old must be accompanied by a paid and participating a
 dult. </p><p>Ages 16+ may attend solo. </p><p>Minimum 1 student\, Maximum 8
  students</p><p>Registrations close 12 hours before start of class</p><p><b
 r></p><p>Other Things to Know:</p><p>Cancellation Policy: Full refund avail
 able if given 48 hours notification before start of class. Transfers allowe
 d if given 24 hours notification before start of class. No-shows are not el
 igible for refunds nor transfers. We reserve the right to cancel class for
 teacher illness or inclement weather.</p><p><br></p><p>What to Bring:</p><p
 >•        Please email longmontcrochet@gmail.com or text 720-927-7278 and i
 ndicate if you are *right* handed or *left* handed.</p><p>•        You don'
 t NEED to bring any supplies\, but if you have yarn and/or hooks already\,
 you can bring them and we can discuss whether or not they are good for begi
 nners.</p><p>•        $5 optional materials donation is appreciated and can
  be paid to instructor at start of class (cash\, check\, Venmo or Zelle).</
 p><p><br></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260724T172924Z
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Beginning crochet with Amber
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
