DESCRIPTION:\nBeginning with a Day of the Dead Invocation led by Grupo Azte
 ca Tlahuitzcalli\, The Firehouse Art Center will unveil a new exhibit to ho
 nor the Día de los Muertos. The Second Friday opening will offer an in pers
 on celebration as well as an online livestream event.  We invite you to joi
 n us\, meet our artists\, and to bid on our Catrina Painting Auction.  Thes
 e Catrina Paintings were created by your local community and will support t
 he Firehouse Art Centers programs\, exhibits and events!  The Catrina Paint
 ing Auction will end at 10pm.  Admission is free and we will have timed tic
 kets to ensure safe social distancing.
