DESCRIPTION:Longmont for Palestine invites you to our free community sign-m
 aking event\, Posters & Signs for Collective Liberation!\n\nWe’ll be gather
 ing in community to create rally signs with messages and art in support of
 collective struggles\, resistance\, and liberation\, from Palestine to Turt
 le to Island.\n\nSnacks\, signs\, and art supplies will be provided. \n\nLo
 ngmont for Palestine is a group of Longmont residents interested in efforts
  meant to help end hostilities in Gaza (and the West Bank) and to promote f
 reedom and liberation for the people of Palestine. We share information\, h
 ost local gatherings\, and support and fundraise efforts for families in Ga
 za.
LAST-MODIFIED:20250302T030054Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Palestine poster printing event
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
