DESCRIPTION:<br>Join us at the Gordon Gamm Theater in the Dairy Art Center
 as our teen designers SLAY the RUNWAY!<br><br>Although tickets are free you
  must REGISTER. Link for tickets will be posted once it is live.<br><br>Sla
 y the Runway offers fashion design\, performance and sewing classes for LGB
 TQIA+ teens and ally teens in Longmont and Boulder. At the conclusion of a
 2 week Summer Session\, students participate in a professionally produced r
 unway show. In addition to garment construction and design\, participants w
 ill work with make-up artists and choreographers to refine their debuts. Th
 is program is offered at no cost to participants and is made possible by SC
 FD\, Community Foundation Boulder County\, Longmont Community Foundation\,
 the City of Longmont and our amazing donors!<br><br>To learn more about Sla
 y visit <a href="https://firehouseart.org/slay-the-runway/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgN
