DESCRIPTION: Intro to Mending: Shorts and Pants<br>Sign up here- <a href="h
 ttps://www.hisawyer.com/firehouse-art-center-1/schedules/activity-set/13003
 40?day=2025-04-19&amp\;view=cal&amp\;source=all-activities">Firehouse Art C
 enter - Intro to Mending- Pants and Shorts</a><br><p>Adult Sewing Classes</
 p><p>*Ages 18-118</p><p><br></p><p>-Alterations and Mending: Pants and Shor
 ts: Participants will learn the basics of hemming pant legs\, adjusting wai
 stlines\, and mending tears in knees and crotches. Please bring some pants
 or shorts to work on\, patches and additional materials will be provided.</
 p><p><br></p><p>- 3 hr class\, BYOM if desired. 2-8 max\, no prerequisites<
 /p><p><br></p><p>*Pricing</p><p>Mending and Alterations -$110</p><p><br></p
 ><p>- Small class size means small class experience!</p><p>- tools and mate
 rials provided</p><p><br></p><p>Meet your instructor!<br><br>Steffie Notion
 <br>Steffie Notion is a textile artist and seamstress based in Longmont\, C
 O. She learned to sew from her mom and now has over 20 years of experience
 specializing in practical alterations and mending. Her work emphasizes sust
 ainability\, focusing on the importance of repurposing and repairing old cl
 othes to reduce waste. She actively shares her expertise through workshops
 and classes\, encouraging others to embrace creativity and resourcefulness
 in their own sewing journeys.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20250213T203423Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Intro to Mending- Shorts and Pants
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
