DESCRIPTION:What is artist circle? A bunch of artists of all mediums sit do
 wn and create in the same space while sharing mealtime\, conversation and c
 amaraderie.\n\nLaugh\, get out and meet people\, work on your own stuff and
  see what everyone else is working on. We meet on the 2nd Monday of the mon
 th.\n\nThis new group plans to meet on the second Monday of every month fro
 m 12:30 noon - 3:30 PM with the goal of working on individual projects whil
 e sharing creative energies and inspiration and conversation in a casual\,
 supportive gathering. All interested individuals are invited to bring whate
 ver creative project they have in process to work on. No fees. Donations to
  The Firehouse are welcomed but not required. Bring a friend or meet new on
 es. If you have any questions and/ or think you might come\, please send a
 text to Kathy Hall at 303-746-0629 so we know approximately how many to set
  up for. Thank you.
LAST-MODIFIED:20261030T012229Z
LOCATION:Firehouse Art Center\, Longmont\, Colorado\, United States\, 80501
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Firehouse Artist's Circle
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
