DESCRIPTION:<br><br><br><br><h1><b>Adult Watercolor and Origami Class- See
 description for schedule of focus for each week</b></h1><br><br><h4><span s
 tyle="font-weight: normal\;">Sign up here- </span><a href="https://www.hisa
 wyer.com/firehouse-art-center-1/schedules/activity-set/1968144?source=all-a
 ctivities">Firehouse Art Center - Adult Watercolor and Origami Class- See d
 escription for schedule of focus for each week</a> </h4><h4><span style="fo
 nt-weight: normal\;">Joyful watercolor class is designed to help students d
 iscover their inner connection to nature and art by using various watercolo
 r techniques to create floral and landscape painting </span></h4><br><p><br
 ></p><p>The origami class is designed to encourage mindfulness and creativi
 ty through the art of paper folding\, creating both traditional and playful
  origami designs.</p><p><br></p><p>Class fee- $45</p><p>Material fee : Mate
 rials will be provided free of charge </p><p>Age Range : 18+</p><p>Skill Le
 vel: Beginner or intermediate </p><p><br></p><p>Class Format: Watercolor an
 d Origami classes alternate every other week.</p><p>Date| Class</p><p>Augus
 t 25| Watercolor</p><p>September 1| Origami</p><p>September 8| Watercolor</
 p><p>September 15| Origami</p><p>September 22| Watercolor</p><p>September 2
 9| Origami</p><p>October 6| Watercolor</p><p>October 13| Origami</p><p>Octo
 ber 20| Watercolor</p><p>October 27| Origami</p><p>November 3| Watercolor</
 p><p>November 10| Origami</p><p>November 17| Watercolor</p><p>November 24|
 No Class – Thanksgiving Week</p><p>December 1| Origami</p><p>December 8| Wa
 tercolor</p><p>December 15| Origami</p><p><br></p><p>Pre-registration and c
 onfirmation are required.</p><p>If there are no registrations 24 hours befo
 re the class starts\, the class will be canceled.</p><p>Students must conta
 ct the instructor directly to arrange exceptions.</p><p><br></p><p>Refunds
 will only be given to students that inform the Firehouse within 48hours of
 the class start. Notifications given 24 hours before class start can be tra
 nsferred to a future class. Past 24 hours forfeit class fee.<br></p>
