DESCRIPTION:Source of All Hair\, Wearer of All Socks<br>Samantha Modder<br>
 AUGUST 8- SEPTEMBER 7\, 2025<br>EXHIBIT RECEPTION- AUGUST 8\, 6PM-8PM<br>In
  "Source of All Hair\, Wearer of All Socks" Modder combines storybook with
 mural\, creating narrative installations that serve as an allegory for our
 contemporary condition\, confronting questions of power\, exploitation\, an
 d resistance.<br>In this series\, a Black woman escapes from everything but
  herself. Her Black-only dream world is less utopia and more speculative te
 st lab\, a way to decenter broken realities and focus instead on the imagin
 ary to help understand and rethink oppressive structures.<br><br>Enjoy live
  music and refreshments available for donation. All receptions are $5 sugge
 sted donation and open to the public.<br><br>Music by Jeff Ulrich<br><a hre
 f="https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Ffirehouseart.org%2Fexhibiti
 ons%2Fupcoming-exhibitions%3Ffbclid%3DIwAR1qt0c0IeNEIdUEt_NjtX6yxR2D5UW_DQO
 j3_Ncjkq4-_zj7ZYAoctJEoY&h=AT1-4Gtoz_ADK2jyEjNWQyNigk7CX2-IwOrR7-PiAfYHWJBG
 p847P5nxMSA6807kC-YSdVPz5JGr1mog8DezVyPg_jB00UNcQkgNUKach4bzy4q9AdIncd0HXxj
 2GOBw5Q&__tn__=q&c[0]=AT2U2D0xK8jj1MHxGcKXc8n3lzN0A4NyHMyMbRte1PxzAxkzZnGg8
 x03JXp5H_FCNK50-omllz-yBM4CuoPtMP27dNRxcWH6HDMQoKVOGcE09-AJ6F2V31cCqzdXGdqb
 QJCuxIGbDxZsZmy5ioMhbXgs3xj1rdO9nRkU3C2LduM1bL_Z" target="_blank">https://f
 irehouseart.org/exhibitions/upcoming-exhibitions</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260504T213517Z
