 Center - Upcycled Cosplay</a><br>Ages 8+<br><p>Instructor- Joyanna Gittings
 </p><p>From concept to execution\, make your cosplay dreams come to life! 
 Dream up a costume- anything from favorite characters to original creations
 : design\, source materials\, and bring it into reality.  Learn about the e
 lements of costume\, techniques\, and materials.  We may use sewing\, hot g
 luing\, painting\, dying\, learning stage makeup and prosthetics\, molding
 and paper machè\, or other techniques\, and movement!  Materials will be mo
 stly thrifted and repurposed.  Bring snacks and your imagination.</p>
