DESCRIPTION:<p><b>Art with Books and Artists #1</b></p><p>June 23-June 27 <
 /p><p>9am - 12 am - (3 hours)</p><p>age 6-9</p><p>Join Sara Broers Brown fo
 r a morning of making art inspired by book illustrators including Eric Carl
 e and Dr. Seuss and famous artists such as Claude Monet and Paul Klee. Duri
 ng the week we will explore our creativity with paint. pastels\, scissors a
 nd glue\, and much more. Younger inspiring artists will have help with any
 skills they have yet mastered. Sara is a Colorado K-12 Licensed Art Educato
 r with over 25 years of experience and is sure to fill the week with explor
 ation and colorful art that might earn a frame. Be prepared to have a littl
 e bit of the sillies and movement. It’s recommended to bring an apron or ov
 ersized shirt that can get messy. Also bring a water vessel with a closed l
 id.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20250619T065739Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Art with Books and Artists #1
TRANSP:OPAQUE
