DESCRIPTION:Life Drawing with Art of Modeling- Monday nights<br>Firehouse A
 rt Center\, Longmont\, Colorado\, United States\, 80501<br><a href="https:/
 /www.hisawyer.com/firehouse-art-center-1/schedules/activity-set/1219039">Fi
 rehouse Art Center - Life Drawing on Mondays</a><br><br>The Firehouse is pr
 oud to offer a weekly life drawing session coordinated with Art of Modeling
 .<br><br>There will be minimal supplies available\, it is recommended to br
 ing your own drawing or water based materials: the Firehouse provides chair
 s and tables\, BYO easel.<br><br>In this two-hour session poses vary from s
 hort gestures to 15 or 25 minute studies in an open-studio format. This is
 not an instructor-led class: artists are invited to practice their craft in
  their own style.<br><br>All artists are responsible for cleaning their are
 a after class. Charcoal and paper are provided\, but it is recommended to b
 ring your own.<br><br>Space is LIMITED.<br><br>Discount pricing for Firehou
 se Artist members (use code AMEM for a $3 discount)\, space is limited. Doo
 rs close 5 minutes after class start and open 15 minutes before.<br><br>JAN
 UARY<br>6-Greg<br>13-Riza<br>20-Val<br>27-Kayla<br><br>Art of Modeling may
 make substitutions based on model availability or needs\, so listed models
 are not guaranteed
