DESCRIPTION:<br>Come and screenprint a tote bag with our Slay 2025 Design!
 There will be a few designs to choose from. With a donation of $15 or more\
 , you can either print your own tote\, or have one of our volunteers print
 one for you!<br>The money collected goes to support SLAY THE RUNWAY\, our t
 een fashion design program that offers a safe\, creative\, gender expansive
  space for teens to find their true style\, at no cost to them!<br>Slay the
  Runway offers fashion design\, performance and sewing classes for LGBTQIA+
  teens in Logmont and Boulder. At the conclusion of a 2 week Summer Session
 \, students participate in a professionally produced runway show. In additi
 on to garment construction and design\, participants will work with make-up
  artists and choreographers to refine their debuts.<br>Read more about Slay
  here- <a href="https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Ffirehouseart.o
 rg%2Fslay-the-runway%2F%3Ffbclid%3DIwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExejJwYjFJUjlyQm
