 4bNMt" target="_blank">Firehouse Art Center - TRELLIS VASES WORKSHOP</a><br
 ><br>Build a trellis-inspired ceramic vase in this handbuilding workshop. W
 e’ll explore structure\, cut-out patterns\, and coiled clay techniques to c
 reate open forms that echo garden trellises and plant supports. You&#39\;ll
  create a lovely vase.<br><p>Clay and bisque firing included. Additional fe
 e to glaze and fire.<br></p>
