DTSTART:20250329T210000Z
DTEND:20250330T010000Z
DTSTAMP:20261030T045920Z
UID:46ue5i5csnn5s6ml1n21j5sobl@google.com
CREATED:20250213T202216Z
DESCRIPTION:Sign up here: <a href="https://www.hisawyer.com/firehouse-art-c
 enter-1/schedules/activity-set/1300332?day=2025-03-29&amp\;view=cal&amp\;so
 urce=all-activities">Firehouse Art Center - Intro to Sewing Machines</a><br
 ><p>Adult Sewing Classes</p><p>*Ages 18-118</p><p><br></p><p>-Intro to Sewi
 ng Machines: Tote or pillow - Participants will receive an introduction to
 sewing machines\, practice sewing straight lines and getting comfortable wi
 th the basics of the machine\, participants will make either a checkerboard
  throw pillow or a tote bag using paper patterns and materials provided. Br
 ing your own machine if you’d like to get more comfortable using it. </p><p
 ><br></p><p>4hr class\, 3-6 max\, no prerequisites </p><p>- Small class siz
 e means small class experience!</p><p>- tools and materials provided</p><p>
 <br></p><p>Intro to Sewing Machines- $170</p><p><br></p><p>Meet your instru
 ctor!<br><br>Steffie Notion<br>Steffie Notion is a textile artist and seams
 tress based in Longmont\, CO. She learned to sew from her mom and now has o
 ver 20 years of experience specializing in practical alterations and mendin
 g. Her work emphasizes sustainability\, focusing on the importance of repur
 posing and repairing old clothes to reduce waste. She actively shares her e
 xpertise through workshops and classes\, encouraging others to embrace crea
 tivity and resourcefulness in their own sewing journeys.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20250213T203552Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Intro to Sewing- tote or pillow
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
