DESCRIPTION:Longmont Loves: Community Activation through Art and Creativity
 <br>More info- <a href="https://www.facebook.com/events/1972959760238147"> 
 Longmont Loves: Community Activation through Art and Creativity | Facebook<
 /a><br>Come enjoy a day that will make you feel good inside and out!<br>We
 are hosting another Mutual Aid event for Longmont Food Rescue! We will be p
 rotest printing and there will be a clothing swap!<br>One food item means y
 ou can get 5 clothing items from the clothing swap\, 2 food items equals 10
  clothing items!<br>What is protest printing?<br>We will have 2 prints to c
 hoose from! A Slow Fashion turtle or a Melt Ice print- you can choose to pr
 int your own or have our printer print.<br>poster ($5) tote ($8) or shirt (
 $18)<br>Longmont Loves is our way to activate our community through art and
  creativity in a way that helps those in need. We hope you’ll be a part of
 it!<br>In parternship with Longmont Food Rescue\, Fashion Rebel-ution and V
 ulture Collective
LAST-MODIFIED:20260218T211952Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Longmont Loves- Mutual Aid Event to benefit Longmont food Rescue
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
