UID:cuounocoj83er22pb2nabcl7jc@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/Denver:20250908T123000
CREATED:20230718T181548Z
DESCRIPTION:Sept 8 Artist Circle will be held at Old Town Marketplace due t
 o exhibit install- Old Town Marketplace- 332 Main. \n\nWhat is artist circl
 e?  A bunch of artists of all mediums sit down and create in the same space
  while sharing mealtime\, conversation and camaraderie. \n\n\nLaugh\, get o
 ut and meet people\, work on your own stuff and see what everyone else is w
 orking on.  We meet on the 2nd Monday of the month.\n\nThis new group plans
  to meet on the second Monday of every month from 12:00 noon - 2:30 PM with
  the goal of working on individual projects while sharing creative energies
  and inspiration and conversation in a casual\, supportive gathering. All i
 nterested individuals are invited to bring whatever creative project they h
 ave in process to work on. No fees. Donations to The Firehouse are welcomed
  but not required. Bring a friend or meet new ones. If you have any questio
 ns and/ or think you might come\, please send a text to Kathy Hall at 303-7
 46-0629 so we know approximately how many to set up for. Thank you.\n\nSign
  up here- Firehouse Artist's Circle Tickets\, Multiple Dates | Eventbrite
LAST-MODIFIED:20261030T012229Z
LOCATION:Firehouse Art Center\, Longmont\, Colorado\, United States\, 80501
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Firehouse Artist's Circle at OTM this month
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
