DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://firehouseart.org/special-events/monthly-events
 /" target="_blank">Monthly Events - Firehouse Art Center</a><br><p dir="ltr
 ">Firehouse Filmmakers offers social meetups and filmmaking workshops here
 in Longmont\, Colorado. Our monthly social event is <b>First Tuesday Brews<
 /b>\, which happens on the <b>first Tuesday of the month at 300 Suns Brewin
 g</b> in downtown Longmont from <b>7:30-8:30 PM</b>. Enjoy a tasty brew and
  casual conversation with other filmmakers about your current projects\, yo
 ur favorite movies\, or whatever else happens to be on your mind.</p><p dir
 ="ltr">Firehouse Filmmakers is organized by Firehouse member and local film
 maker\, <a href="https://sunnypictures.co/"><u>Allison Radomski</u></a>. Yo
 u’re invited to follow her on Instagram (<a href="https://www.instagram.com
 /sunnypictures.co/"><u>@sunnypictures.co</u></a>) for updates on this group
 . You are also welcome to subscribe to the Firehouse Filmmakers newsletter
 so that you can stay up to date on all of our events. Please click<a href="
 https://sunnypictures.co/firehousefilmmakers"> <u>here</u></a> to subscribe
 !</p><p dir="ltr">Got questions about Firehouse Filmmakers? Feel free to se
 nd an email to Allison at <a href="mailto:hello@sunnypictures.co"><u>hello@
 sunnypictures.co</u></a>. See you soon!</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260514T202815Z
LOCATION:300 Suns Brewing\, 335 1st Ave Unit C\, Longmont\, CO 80501\, USA
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Filmmakers meetup- 300 Suns
TRANSP:OPAQUE
