 nstall their work\, including time to patch the walls and help paint on Nov
 ember 30th.</p><br><br> Hang Time opens on November 6th at 6pm.<br><br>Sout
 h Gallery- Artist in Residence Robyn Eubanks<br>Music by Laurie Dameron
