DESCRIPTION:<br>Out of the Box- Art\, Music\, Cider and Spirits!<br><a href
 ="https://www.facebook.com/events/1280751120241247/">https://www.facebook.c
 om/events/1280751120241247/</a><br>The Summer Festival celebrates Live Musi
 c\, Local Art\, Cider\, and Spirits. The Firehouse UHaul Galleries are also
  returning! Inside the moving trucks will be curated Mobile Art Galleries\,
  with most trucks hosting solo artist immersive art experiences.<br>Your ho
 sts:<br>St. Vrain Cidery- Cider is more than just a drink - it’s a passion
 rooted in tradition\, creativity and celebration. When we opened St. Vrain
 Cidery in October 2016\, our goal was to share our love of cider and our lo
 ve of Colorado.<br>Abbott &amp\; Wallace- Grain-to-Glass Distillery Craftin
 g Small-Batch Bourbon\, Botanical Gin\, and a New Frontier of Zero-Proof Gi
 n &amp\; Whiskey. Whether you're sipping full-strength or going zero\, our
 spirits are made with obsessive care\, local ingredients\, and unapologetic
  flavor.<br>Firehouse Art Center- The Firehouse Art Center inspires cultura
 l engagement and human connection by providing<br>life enhancing experience
 s through exhibitions\, education and community events. Out of the Box even
 ts celebrate creativity outside of the gallery- connecting out community to
  art in new ways!<br>Longmont Creative District- The Longmont Creative Dist
 rict is where art\, culture\, performance\, craft food and beverage\, and c
 ommunity come together. Launched through Colorado Creative Industries’ (CCI
 ) statewide program and managed by Longmont Creates\, Downtown has been off
 icially recognized since 2014 as 1 of 45 state-certified Creative Districts
 . Longmont is on the map as a hub for creativity\, local talent\, and cultu
 ral experiences that spark joy and drive community pride.<br>Saturday\, Jul
 y 11<br>3pm-5pm- Colorado Djembe Orchestra<br>5pm-7pm- Tim and Jenny Ostdie
 k<br>7pm- 9pm- DJ Sh34<br>UHaul Mobile Art Experiences-<br>Artists TBA<br>A
 rt Market-<br>Artists TBA<br>Food Trucks- Nice Ice and MT's Fry Bread &amp\
 ; Indian Tacos.
