BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20261107T210000Z
DTEND:20261107T230000Z
DTSTAMP:20261030T045920Z
UID:012q84phsopakmaho59uvtv0hu@google.com
CREATED:20260817T174921Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>Sign up here- <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://
 www.hisawyer.com/firehouse-art-center-1/schedules/activity-set/1993298&amp\
 ;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;ust=1787357189427716&amp\;usg=AOvVaw0AJVgrr
 3OTdhIiRnlR7gra" target="_blank">Firehouse Art Center - Finding the Art Spi
 rit</a></p><p>A Living Encounter with the Art Spirit: Connecting with your
 Creative Voice</p><p>Inspired by the great Robert Henri’s Art Spirit\, this
  hand-on workshop explores creativity and personal vision over perfection.
 We start with an introduction of Robert Henri and a discussion about creati
 vity and self-expression. We then explore our own Art Spirits using Henri’s
  approach\, sketching and then painting a simple still-life focusing on com
 positional areas\, color and brushstrokes. During the workshop\, you’ll dis
 cover “that wonderful state which makes art inevitable.” </p><p><br></p><p>
 Class Fee/Materials Fee: $45 includes materials</p><p>Age Range: Adults 16+
 </p><p>Skill Level: All</p><p><br></p><p>Class duration- 2 hours</p><p>Loca
 tion- Upstairs classroom</p><p><br></p><p>Karrie Steely is an artist\, inst
 ructor\, and arts community builder. She is passionate about sharing the gi
 fts of a lifelong commitment to creativity and curiosity. Collaborators\, c
 ohorts and students alike are inspired by her joy and enthusiasm.</p><p> </
 p><p>Karrie’s award-winning artwork has been exhibited in Colorado\, Nebras
 ka and Kansas. So far\, 2026 projects have included an artist residency at
 the Robert Henri Museum and Gallery where she taught workshops\, leading co
 mmunity murals in Nebraska\, and judging at the Nebraska State Fair. She wa
 s a 2023-2025 Rural Regenerator Fellow with Springboard for the Arts. She r
 ecently moved back to her native Colorado\, where she continues to lead wor
 kshops and paint murals.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260817T174921Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Finding the Art Spirit
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
