DESCRIPTION:<p>Sign up here- <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://
 www.hisawyer.com/firehouse-art-center-1/schedules/activity-set/1968132?sour
 ce%3Dall-activities&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;ust=178535370699859
 7&amp\;usg=AOvVaw3lmwhZqBlJ_ynI2zh3RUnF" target="_blank">Firehouse Art Cent
 er - After School Origami/Paper Folding and Watercolor (see description for
  Class medium)</a> </p><p>This class sparks children&#39\;s interest in art
 \, helps them discover their talents\, and builds creativity and confidence
  through drawing\, watercolor and Origami.</p><p>We will alternate the clas
 ses\, doing a watercolor class one week and an origami class the following
 week.</p><p>Class fee: $ 40</p><p>Age range: 6 -13</p><p>Class size : 1- 6<
 /p><p><br></p><p>Meet your Instructor:<br>I&#39\;m Junghwa Lee\, I am marri
 ed with two children. I originally came from South Korea in 1998 and have b
 een living in Longmont since 2001. I teach watercolor painting classes to b
 eginners and intermediate students.</p><p><br></p><p>Pre-registration and c
 onfirmation are required.</p><p>If there are no registrations 24 hours befo
 re the class starts\, the class will be canceled.</p><p>Students must conta
 ct the instructor directly to arrange exceptions.</p><p><br></p><p>Refunds
 will only be given to students that inform the Firehouse within 48hours of
 the class start. Notifications given 24 hours before class start can be tra
 nsferred to a future class. Past 24 hours forfeit class fee. </p><p><br></p
 ><p>Children&#39\;s After-School Art Classes</p><p>Day: Fridays</p><p>Time:
  3:30 PM – 5:30 PM</p><p>Class Format: Origami and Watercolor classes alter
 nate every other week.</p><p>Date| Class</p><p>August 28| Origami</p><p>Sep
 tember 4| Watercolor</p><p>September 11| Origami</p><p>September 18| Waterc
 olor</p><p>September 25| Origami</p><p>October 2| Watercolor</p><p>October
 9| Origami</p><p>October 16| Watercolor</p><p>October 23| Origami</p><p>Oct
 ober 30| Watercolor</p><p>November 6| Origami</p><p>November 13| Watercolor
 </p><p>November 20| Origami</p><p>November 27| No Class – Thanksgiving Week
 </p><p>December 4| Watercolor</p><p>December 11| Origami</p><p>December 18|
  Watercolor<br></p>
