DESCRIPTION:<p>AfterSchool Craft Club- sign up here- <a href="https://www.h
 isawyer.com/firehouse-art-center-1/schedules/activity-set/1967944?source=al
 l-activities">Firehouse Art Center - After School Craft Club</a></p><br><br
 ><p>After School Craft Club- </p><p>Ages 6-11</p><p>3:45pm-5:15pm</p><p>6 w
 eek session</p><p>$180 for total session</p><p>A fun mix of process art and
