DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://www.hisawyer.com/firehouse-art-center-1/schedu
 les/activity-set/2022700" target="_blank">Firehouse Art Center - Gaia Fiya-
  Performance Event</a><br>Gaia Fiya!<br>Gaia Fiya! This is NOT A CLASS! It
 is a performance offering... A new collaborative container gathering expres
 sive treasures from mining and meditations on the yearnings of our mother p
 lanet. Our inspirations and rituals are channels for her embodied communica
 tions and transformations. We begin with music\, spoken word\, butoh...<br>
 <br>Lisa Adeva Samoy\, the maternal visionary for this project\, is a spoke
 n word artist/poet\, MFA Theatre:  Contemporary Performance artivist\, Rolf
  Method Structural Integrator\, Core Synchronism Practitioner\, ceramicist\
 , and dance devotee. Her sessions and classes are offered out of Elite Heal
 ing and Rehab in North Boulder. Lisa is an artist/member of Firehouse Art C
 enter.<br><br>Maureen Momo Freehill\, MFA in Directing Asian Theater Perfor
 mance\; with over 40 years as performing artist including 20 years with Jap
 anese founders of Butoh\, Kazuo + Yoshito Ohno. Has Sanctuary of Moving Art
 s (SOMA) in Niwot where she hosts a wide variety of community art + healing
  sessions\, classes + events.<br><br>Zuki was born in Boulder\, raised in W
 ard\, and started playing drums at age 8. They also play piano and guitar\,
  learning songs by ear as well as writing original music. Their influences
 include Alex G\, Gasoline Lollipops\, and Fever the Ghost.<br><br>Darbie is
  guitarist for Boulder-based teen punk phenomenon Mykarkrash and has been k
 nown to sub in on bass with Suburban Nightmare. She started playing drums a
 t age 4 and violin at age 10.<br><br>6:30pm doors <br>7pm show
LAST-MODIFIED:20260915T163559Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Gaia Fiya- Performance event
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
