DESCRIPTION:Rework\, Revive\, Renew at mend and sew on the 3rd Sunday of th
 e month 10-12<br><br>sign up here - <a href="https://www.hisawyer.com/fireh
 ouse-art-center-1/schedules/activity-set/1219025">Firehouse Art Center - Me
 nd and Sew</a><br><br>Class Experience<br>MEND AND SEW- THIRD SUNDAYS<br>FR
 EE- BUT MACHINE RENTAL IS $5<br>USE CODE NOMACH IF YOU DO NOT NEED A MACHIN
 E<br><br><br>Rework\, Revive\, Renew at mend and sew on the 3rd Sunday of t
 he month 1-3<br><br>Embark on a sewing adventure with Fashion REBELution at
  the Firehouse Arts Center in Longmont\, CO!<br><br>Join us for an afternoo
 n of social stitching\, where threads weave stories of sustainable style. T
 his FREE event is not just about learning to sew\; it’s about connecting wi
 th a community that stitches together a more conscious\, connected\, and st
 ylish world. To ensure a tailored experience\, we kindly ask you to RSVP so
  we can prepare a personalized sewing kit just for you.<br><br>DON'T NEED A
  MACHINE? JUST USE THE CODE NOMACH.<br><br>Let’s stitch a future thats both
  fashionable and mindful together!<br><br>What To Bring<br>BRINGING A MACHI
 NE?  JUST USE CODE NOMACH OR A FREE TICKET
