DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://www.hisawyer.com/firehouse-art-center-1/schedu
 les/activity-set/1692191?day=2026-01-09&amp\;view=cal&amp\;source=all-activ
 ities">Firehouse Art Center - After School Origami/Paper Folding</a><br><br
 ><br><br><p>Origami offers numerous benefits\, including enhancing creativi
 ty\,  improving concentration and patience\, and strengthening hand-eye coo
 rdination. It also provides the joy of making things by hand and a  sense o
 f accomplishment. In this class\, you will learn techniques ranging from ba
 sic to advanced\, with all materials included in the class  fee.<br><br>  C
 lass Content:<br>- Basic and advanced origami techniques<br>- Hearts and he
 art-shaped boxes\, rabbits and envelopes<br>- Butterflies\, boxes\, and fou
 r-leaf clovers<br>- Flowers\, animals\, dresses<br>- Cranes\, brooches\, he
 art-shaped boxes\, and more<br><br>If you are interested in origami\, join
 us for a fun and meaningful experience<br><br>Class fee $35(each class)<br>
 Age Range: 6-13 years<br>Class Size: Minimum 1 student\, maximum 6 students
 <br>Skill Level: All levels are welcome<br>Please pack a snack and water bo
 ttle/beverage for your child</p><p>Meet your Instructor:<br>I'm Junghwa Lee
 \, I am married with two children. I originally came from South Korea in 19
 98 and have been living in Longmont since 2001. I teach watercolor painting
  classes to beginners and intermediate students.</p><p><br></p><p>Pre-regis
 tration and confirmation are required.</p><p>If there are no registrations
 24 hours before the class starts\, the class will be canceled.</p><p>Studen
 ts must contact the instructor directly to arrange exceptions.</p><p><br></
 p><p>Refunds will only be given to students that inform the Firehouse withi
 n 48hours of the class start. Notifications given 24 hours before class sta
 rt can be transferred to a future class. Past 24 hours forfeit class fee. <
 /p><p></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20251112T215548Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Origami Class
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
