DESCRIPTION:<p>What: Play with Clay Night</p><p>Sign up <a href="https://ww
 w.hisawyer.com/firehouse-art-center-1/schedules/activity-set/1219043">Fireh
 ouse Art Center - Play With Clay</a></p><p>Who: Anyone interested in handbu
 ilding ceramics<br><br>Where: Firehouse Art Center Ceramics Studio (Upstair
 s)- 667 4th Ave Longmont\, CO<br><br>Refunds: As this class usually sells o
 ut\, there are no refunds given for Play with Clay without 48 hours notice.
 <br><br>Join us for a casual gathering to play with clay and meet fellow cl
 ay lovers. Open to folks of all levels\, demos will be shown for constructi
 on for beginners or just come and do your own thing! Only 15 dollars and th
 e class covers your clay (up to 5 lbs) and for your pieces to get bisque fi
 red. You can then pick up your fired work to paint at home or bring to our
 next Play with Clay night to glaze the work. Handbuilding projects only. Gl
 aze tickets are for glaze only- no clay.<br><br>Children 14 and under must
 be accompanied by a paid and participating adult.<br><br>Other Things To Kn
 ow:<br><br>Adult Participation Optional.<br>students under 14 need a paid a
 nd participating adult<br><br>Cancellation Policy<br>As this class usually
 sells out\, there are no refunds given for Play with Clay without 48 hours
 notice</p>
