DESCRIPTION:<h1>VISIBLE MENDING BY HAND</h1><br>Sign up here- <a href="http
 s://vulturecollective.corsizio.com/c/641d1e35dccb7294f9e473dc">Vulture Coll
 ective — Textile Love - Visible Mending by Hand (corsizio.com)</a><br><u>Pr
 ice:</u> $40 (includes a take home mending kit)<br><u>Ages:</u> 10+<br>Wed\
 , Sep 20\, 2023\, 6:00 – 8:00 PM MDT<h2><b>Give your well-loved clothes new
  life and beauty</b>.</h2><h2>Don’t let stains\, holes\, and tears send you
 r clothes to the landfill–show your clothes some love and mend them by hand
 !</h2><p>During this 2-hour workshop you will learn 4 basic hand-embroidery
  stitches that can be used to mend\, patch\, and embellish textiles. Make a
  bland garment stunning\, hide or highlight those well earned holes and sta
 ins.</p><p>For the best experience\, bring up to 4 garments with holes\, st
 ains\, and/or rips no larger than 3″.</p><br><b><u><a href="https://vulture
 collective.corsizio.com/c/641d1e35dccb7294f9e473dc">Registration Link</a></
 u></b>
