DESCRIPTION:CURRENTLY CANCELLED DUE TO COVID-19- PLEASE EMAIL INFO@FIREHOUS
 EART.ORG FOR MORE INFO\n\nSPARK works within our community to connect cultu
 ral institutions like the Firehouse with people with mild memory loss\, ear
 ly stage Alzheimer's or other types of dementia accompanied by their careta
 kers.\n\n\nGuided by our two art therapists\, our participants tour the cur
 rent art house exhibition then move to the classroom  for a "hands-on" art
 project. Art can access different parts of the brain where words may not. O
 ur students often vocalize a memory or describe a scene from earlier in lif
 e as a random color or the feel of a piece of paper spurs a recollection. \
 n\n Their caregivers not only receive a cultural break from their loved one
 s\, but\, those vocalizations  are tangible connections to "the person stil
 l inside"\, one of the most difficult\, frustrating and loving challenges a
  caregiver faces every single day.
LAST-MODIFIED:20251007T000343Z
