 28/\n\nWhere: Firehouse Art Center\, 667 4th Ave. Longmont\, CO 80501\nWhen
 : 3rd Tuesday of the month at 6pm\nFREE!\nThe Firehouse Songwriter Workshop
  is for songwriters\, players\, lyricists\, and music-lovers of all ages\,
 levels\, interests\, and tastes!\nBring your lyrics\, songs and instruments
  to join with fellow songwriters to explore the art and craft of songwritin
 g. Share your originals for feedback and constructive comments.\nThe Fireho
 use Songwriter Workshop’s mission is to be a resource for:\n1. Feedback on
 your works-in-progress.\n2. Promotion and exposure for your work through co
 ncert showcases at the Firehouse\, which will be recorded and aired on Long
 mont Public Media’s local Channel 8 television show.\n3. The opportunity to
  build relationships with potential song collaborators.\n4. Networking oppo
 rtunities with local arts organizations and artists in other disciplines.\n
 5. Become part of a community of songwriters who live and work in and aroun
 d Longmont\, Boulder and Denver.
