DESCRIPTION:Life Drawing with Art of Modeling- Monday nights<br>Firehouse A
 rt Center\, Longmont\, Colorado\, United States\, 80501<br><a href="https:/
 /www.hisawyer.com/firehouse-art-center-1/schedules/activity-set/1219039?day
 =2025-08-25&amp\;view=cal&amp\;source=all-activities">Firehouse Art Center
 - Life Drawing on Mondays</a><br><br>The Firehouse is proud to offer a week
 ly life drawing session coordinated with Art of Modeling.<br><br>There will
  be minimal supplies available\, it is recommended to bring your own drawin
 g or water based materials: the Firehouse provides chairs and tables\, BYO
 easel.<br><br>In this two-hour session poses vary from short gestures to 15
  or 25 minute studies in an open-studio format. This is not an instructor-l
 ed class: artists are invited to practice their craft in their own style.<b
 r><br>All artists are responsible for cleaning their area after class. Char
 coal and paper are provided\, but it is recommended to bring your own.<br><
 br>Space is LIMITED.<br><br>Discount pricing for Firehouse Artist members (
 use code AMEM for a $3 discount)\, space is limited. Doors close 5 minutes
 after class start and open 15 minutes before.<br><br>JANUARY<br>6-Greg<br>1
 3-Riza<br>20-Val<br>27-Kayla<br><br>Art of Modeling may make substitutions
 based on model availability or needs\, so listed models are not guaranteed
