DESCRIPTION:Sign up here:<br><a href="https://www.hisawyer.com/firehouse-ar
 t-center-1/schedules/activity-set/1554327?day=2025-08-15&amp\;view=cal&amp\
 ;source=all-activities">Firehouse Art Center - After School Origami/Paper F
 olding</a><br><p>Origami offers numerous benefits\, including enhancing cre
 ativity\,  improving concentration and patience\, and strengthening hand-ey
 e coordination. It also provides the joy of making things by hand and a  se
 nse of accomplishment. In this class\, you will learn techniques ranging fr
 om basic to advanced\, with all materials included in the class  fee.<br><b
 r>  Class Content:<br>- Basic and advanced origami techniques<br>- Hearts a
 nd heart-shaped boxes\, rabbits and envelopes<br>- Butterflies\, boxes\, an
 d four-leaf clovers<br>- Flowers\, animals\, dresses<br>- Cranes\, brooches
 \, heart-shaped boxes\, and more<br><br>If you are interested in origami\,
 join us for a fun and meaningful experience<br><br>Class fee $35(each class
 )<br>Age Range: 6-13 years<br>Class Size: Minimum 1 student\, maximum 6 stu
 dents<br>Skill Level: All levels are welcome<br>Meet your Instructor:<br>I'
 m Junghwa Lee\, I am married with two children. I originally came from Sout
 h Korea in 1998 and have been living in Longmont since 2001. I teach waterc
 olor painting classes to beginners and intermediate students.</p><p><br></p
 ><p>Pre-registration and confirmation are required.</p><p>If there are no r
 egistrations 24 hours before the class starts\, the class will be canceled.
 </p><p>Students must contact the instructor directly to arrange exceptions.
 </p><p><br></p><p>Refunds will only be given to students that inform the Fi
 rehouse within 48hours of the class start. Notifications given 24 hours bef
 ore class start can be transferred to a future class. Past 24 hours forfeit
  class fee. </p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20251112T210547Z
