DESCRIPTION:<br>Volunteer at ArtWalk on Main\, The Firehouse Art Center’s b
 iggest fundraiser and Longmont’s only Festival on Main street! This event i
 s celebrates Longmont’s best in art\, music\, food and fun\, but we can’t d
 o it without you!!!<br><br>ArtWalk returns to Downtown Longmont on Saturday
 \, September 13 from 4PM to 8 PM\, and we need your help to make it all hap
 pen.<br><br>The Firehouse Art Center is Longmont’s creative heart and over
 half of our educational opportunities are offered at no cost to under- reso
 urced and marginalized areas of our community. ArtWalk\, on September 13th\
 , is our largest fundraising event and your volunteer support makes what we
  do possible!<br><br>Volunteering for the first time or want to know what t
 he shifts entail? Come to our Volunteer drop in info event on August 21 fro
 m 5pm-7pm. Drop in any time between 5pm-7pm and see what volunteer options
 there are!<br><br>Returning volunteers can sign up here- <a href="https://l
 .facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.signupgenius.com%2Fgo%2F20F0B4BAAA7
 29A3F49-57561156-september%3Ffbclid%3DIwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExZGtqSUNtZ3F
