 T_4n10huk-m6YNlduq7_e1p-D60__Q&amp\;__tn__=q&amp\;c[0]=AT1i7bl-VYBaF2stxmID
 TdVgQH-niakIeK6k2Asf9TsWdFiVB5PZfPJO7m2_WoXpXZKlP2WXsnVd4shW8iAln9Ee7frzLO4
 4C0jUiNG5PNNRN6HUGfDUxHS7Y6S7YLVrqRZbk-WUa6BrqaLP73uQUP21xJz7gXzooHY" targe
 t="_blank">https://www.signupgenius.com/.../20F0B4BAAA729A3F49...</a><br><b
 r>Questions? Feel free to email info@firehouseart.org.<br><br>All volunteer
 s receive:<br>An ArtWalk volunteer t-shirt<br>Volunteer food station upstai
 rs at the Firehouse Art Center<br>Warm fuzzies that you are part of an amaz
 ing event that brings art and creativity to your community!<br><br>Thank yo
 u to our presenting sponsor- @longmontcreativedistrict <br>More info here- 
 <a href="https://www.facebook.com/events/762779149494156">https://www.faceb
