CREATED:20250825T051828Z
DESCRIPTION:<h1><b>Longmont Loves: Community Activation through Art and Cre
 ativity</b></h1><br><a href="https://www.facebook.com/events/12813704001986
 85">(10) Longmont Loves: Community Activation through Art and Creativity |
 Facebook</a><b></b><br><h2><b>Event description</b></h2><br><p>Come enjoy a
  day that will make you feel good inside and out!<br><br>Fall is here and w
 e are hosting another Mutual Aid event for Slay the Runway and el Comite! 
 We will be protest printing (choose your design and the funds go to that ch
 arity) and there will be a clothing swap (funds benefit Slay the Runway\, o
 ur LGBTQIA+ Design workshop offered at no cost to marginalized and under-re
 sourced areas of our community).</p><p>$5 means you can get 5 clothing item
 s from the clothing swap\, $10 equals 10 clothing items!</p><p>Read more ab
 out <a href="https://firehouseart.org/slay-the-runway/" target="_blank">SLA
 Y</a> and <a href="https://firehouseart.org/slay-the-runway/" target="_blan
 k">El Comite</a>.</p><p>What is protest printing?</p><p>We have asked local
  artists to design screenprints which the Firehouse prepares for printing.
 You can choose tote or t-shirts and based on the design the proceeds will g
 o to either Slay or El Comite. Designs will be posted at the press\, and yo
 u can choose to print your own or have our printer print.</p><p>tote ($8) o
 r shirt ($18)  </p><p>Longmont Loves is our way to activate our community t
 hrough art and creativity in a way that helps those in need. We hope you’ll
  be a part of it!</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20250825T051829Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Longmont Loves- To Benefit Slay
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
