DESCRIPTION:This is not your typical Paint and Pints event!<a href="http://
 bit.ly/2L2xfTg" id="ow2069" __is_owner="true"> Tickets here: http://bit.ly/
 2L2xfTg</a><br><br>Join local Artist Sabrina Ehlert for an evening of Paint
 ing\, Pints and Paper. You will be guided through all the steps of painting
  a bright\, Spring inspired 16×20 canvas\, but when the painting is finishe
 d the fun doesn’t end there…<br><br>Sabrina will go on to demonstrate and i
 nstruct you on the fine art of paper quilling and you will get to add your
 own 3D quilled elements to your painting giving your project a twist that w
 ill make it stand out.<br><br>Tickets start at $40 in advance\, $45 at the
 door. With a $10 discount for Members of the Firehouse!<br><br>Included wit
 h your purchase\, is all of the painting and paper supplies\, detailed inst
 ruction and guidance\, and a drink. At the end of the event\, you will have
  a hand painted\, 16×20 canvas\, created by you. Come out with friends or o
 n your own\, this event is a fun way to kick off the week. <br><br>Event No
 tes:<br>Paint with a Twist is geared towards adults 21+\, however teens and
  older children are welcome with a parent/guardian. Participants must be 21
 + to enjoy the complimentary alcholic beverage. Non alcoholic beverages are
  available by request.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260409T205932Z
LOCATION:Main Gallery
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Paint with a Twist  with Sabrina Ehlert
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
