DESCRIPTION:<p>Sign up here-<a href="https://www.hisawyer.com/firehouse-art
 -center-1/schedules/activity-set/1888965">https://www.hisawyer.com/firehous
 e-art-center-1/schedules/activity-set/1888965</a></p><p>We are partnering w
 ith the Longmont Library and Butterscotch Studios to present an art exhibit
  for Pride to show at the library on June 7th.  The pieces in the show will
  be created over a series of 5 art classes at the Firehouse.  </p><p>Saturd
 ay- May 16- Bring your homies and make some gnomies...In this beginner clay
