  a gnome and if there is time\, a mushroom house! We'll talk about fantasti
 cal worlds and building spaces where everyone can feel safe. You will come
 back to glaze after we bisque fire it in 1 week. </p><p>Return to glaze you
 r gnomies on Saturday- May 30- Glaze your gnomies- this is a low key class
 where gnomes and mushroom houses can be glazed.</p>
