DESCRIPTION:<br>Purchase tickets here-<br><a href="https://www.google.com/u
 rl?q=https://www.hisawyer.com/firehouse-art-center-1/schedules/activity-set
 /1595257?fbclid%3DIwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExZGtqSUNtZ3FtTXdMSElBdQEefIYXzFt
 pWLe8nTilay3uirxvvVNsLTd93MhrBB8QaESBUWD5u-Yj6uM7SW0_aem_o0dLTKa4xMEboQqVKa
 3E8Q&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;ust=1755989006910703&amp\;usg=AOvV
 aw0--L_jNP-JgOpAwbQ2A6wu" target="_blank">https://www.hisawyer.com/.../sche
 dules/activity-set/1595257</a><br><br>This October we are celebrating artis
 ts! Come to the Firehouse Beaux Arts Ball dressed as your favorite artist o
 r work of art (totally open to your creative interpretation!). We are all a
 rtists here\, so go ahead and get kooky\, weird and creative with the theme
 .<br><br>We all know this is a difficult time for creativity and expression
 \, so join us on a night that thrives on the spirit of rebellion and innova
 tion\, providing a platform for marginalized voices and challenging societa
 l norms. Help us embrace the feeling of artistic defiance but also cultivat
 e a vibrant community that champions creativity in the face of adversity.<b
 r><br>Self-expression through fashion is highly encouraged at the Beaux Art
 s Ball\, whether you’re wearing your finest formals\, vintage interpretatio
 ns\, or full on costumes. Guests wishing to show off their outfits at the B
 all will be invited to strut across the dance floor during the GRAND PROMEN
 ADE starting at 8pm. The dress code is “Favorite Artist or Work of Art” but
  as always\, this is an optional dress theme\, not a requirement – feel fre
 e to dress in your own preferred level of formals.<br><br>Enjoy the donatio
 n-based bar service and indulge in a delectable selection of hors d’oeuvres
 . Visit the photo studio on site for complimentary portraits. Silent auctio
 n of our Firehouse Catrinas will be available for bidding until 9:30pm.<br>
 <br>Since its founding in 1986\, the non-profit Firehouse Art Center has fi
 lled a unique niche in the community by providing educational programs for
 all ages\, free exhibitions where anyone can engage with art and artists\,
 and cultural events connecting creatives to the community. The Beaux Arts B
 all provides an additional avenue to encourage creative expression\, someth
 ing that has always been at the core of the Firehouse&#39\;s mission. Funds
  raised at this event will help continue its crucial work bringing the arts
  to Longmont\, Colorado
LAST-MODIFIED:20250818T230542Z
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Beaux Arts Ball
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
