UID:7svdlq4lm4psh1fdg2kgl5d41d@google.com
CREATED:20260629T170907Z
DESCRIPTION:<br><br><br><h1>Degas Dancers to benefit the Centennial State B
 allet</h1><br>Auction Site- <a href="https://degasdancerscsb.auctria.events
 ">https://degasdancerscsb.auctria.events</a><br><br><br><br><p><strong><b>A
 rtWalk on Main</b></strong></p><p>At ArtWalk on Main 2025\, presented by th
 e Firehouse Art Center\, 18 artists came together to draw a rotating roster
  of dancers. These models were all skilled dancers who have a deep understa
 nding on how the body moves. This collaboration let to the beautiful art th
 at will be auctioned starting at 1 pm on April 28th and ending on July 3rd
 at 8pm.</p><p>Participating artists: Annie Brothers\, Lydia Pottoff\, Lamya
  Deeb\, Elaine Waterman and Sierra Nicole Rhoden</p><p>Mediums: Artists cre
 ated works in Collage\, Oil\, Acrylic\, and Pastel.</p><p>Join us at the Ga
 llery on from July 1st- July 3rd to view the works and bid to support Cente
 nnial State Ballet. Come celebrate the auction close on July 3rd from 6pm-8
 pm. There will be live performances by CSB at 6pm as the auction comes to a
  close. The auction will feature the works created during ArtWalk 2025’s pl
 ein air session on Main.</p><p><strong><b>About Centennial State Ballet</b>
 </strong></p><p>Celebrating our 13th Anniversary as a nonprofit\, we remain
  committed to fostering holistic youth growth as we cultivate tomorrow’s le
 aders. Centennial State Ballet was formed 13 years ago and was built on str
 ong values of inclusivity\, courage\, collaboration\, and excellence\, and
 we strive to act on those values every day. CSB is that bouquet and\, toget
 her\, we dedicate each rehearsal\, performance\, and event to the passion t
 he artform of dance unearths in the soul\; we believe the power of expressi
 vity overcomes any obstacle in a graceful and elegant manner.</p><p>Communi
 ty and Inclusivity: We commit to building community on stage and in hearts
 through collaboration and personal relationships.</p><p>Compassion and Exce
 llence: We devote value to soft skills like self-advocacy\, a strong work e
 thic\, and respectful interactions.</p><p>Collaboration and Optimism: We be
 lieve the transformative power of ballet and movement creates more conscien
 tious humans because our consciousness can be redefined not just as an indi
 vidual process\, but as a shared experience that we can positively influenc
 e by dancing or viewing dance together.</p><br><br><br><br><br><strong><b>E
 xhibit Opening- April 28 at 1pm</b></strong><p><strong><b>Auction- April 28
 - July 3 (ends at 8pm)</b></strong></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260629T170908Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Degas Dancer Auction close and Celebration with Centennial State Ba
 llet
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
