 g</u></a>.</p><p>The painted Catrinas will be auctioned at the end of the e
 xhibit to support our bilingual programing at Casa de la Esperanza and in T
 itle 1 SVVSD school. These programs are offered at no cost to participants.
 </p><p>Links- </p><p><a href="https://www.hisawyer.com/firehouse-art-center
 -1/schedules/activity-set/1539298?day=2025-09-22&amp\;view=cal&amp\;source=
 all-activities">Firehouse Art Center - Catrina Painting Days</a>- afternoon
 s</p>
