DESCRIPTION:<p>What: Play with Clay Night</p><p>Sign up <a href="https://ww
 w.hisawyer.com/firehouse-art-center-1/schedules/activity-set/1219043?day=20
 25-08-27&amp\;view=cal&amp\;source=all-activities">Firehouse Art Center - P
 lay With Clay</a></p><p>Who: Anyone interested in handbuilding ceramics<br>
 <br>Where: Firehouse Art Center Ceramics Studio (Upstairs)- 667 4th Ave Lon
 gmont\, CO<br><br>Refunds: As this class usually sells out\, there are no r
 efunds given for Play with Clay without 48 hours notice.<br><br>Join us for
  a casual gathering to play with clay and meet fellow clay lovers. Open to
 folks of all levels\, demos will be shown for construction for beginners or
  just come and do your own thing! Only 15 dollars and the class covers your
  clay (up to 5 lbs) and for your pieces to get bisque fired. You can then p
 ick up your fired work to paint at home or bring to our next Play with Clay
  night to glaze the work. Handbuilding projects only. Glaze tickets are for
  glaze only- no clay.<br><br>Children 14 and under must be accompanied by a
  paid and participating adult.<br><br>Other Things To Know:<br><br>Adult Pa
 rticipation Optional.<br>students under 14 need a paid and participating ad
 ult<br><br>Cancellation Policy<br>As this class usually sells out\, there a
 re no refunds given for Play with Clay without 48 hours notice</p>
