UID:3vo1m112h137ctihcn2e42aipe@google.com
X-GOOGLE-CONFERENCE:https://hangouts.google.com/hangouts/_/calendar/cjVhMW9
 mcjRzNmQ3bXZ1aWNndnEzNmw2dGNAZ3JvdXAuY2FsZW5kYXIuZ29vZ2xlLmNvbQ.3vo1m112h13
 7ctihcn2e42aipe
CREATED:20180504T175553Z
DESCRIPTION:Firehouse Artist Member Janae Baumhover is teaching a stone scu
 lpture course at the Firehouse! Learn how to carve stone (alabaster) for be
 ginning students. You will learn the whole process of stone carving\, from
 chisels to files and the finishing process. Students are encouraged and hel
 ped to created the style of work that interests them! Class demonstrations
 will accompany peaceful hours of working and connecting to the stone. No pr
 evious experience required! Tools are included\, stone is addition cost. We
  will travel to alabaster supply on the day of the first class to purchase
 our stone. ($1.50 a lb)\n\nPlease register at http://www.janaesculptures.co
 m\, pay via paypal under contact page. \n\n6 classe package- $175.00 (Appro
 x $30.00 a class) \nLocation: Firehouse Art Center in Studio C (upstairs) \
