DESCRIPTION:Sign up here- <a href="https://www.hisawyer.com/firehouse-art-c
 enter-1/schedules/activity-set/1794853?source=all-activities">Firehouse Art
  Center - Runway Rebels: Upcycling Fashion for Kids (8–13)</a><br><br><p>In
 structor- <strong><b>Staci Bernstein</b></strong></p><p>Campers explore a w
 orld where old clothes get a second chance at glory—and sometimes a little
 sparkle too. They’ll learn sewing\, patching\, painting\, and all sorts of
 creative tricks that sneak in problem-solving\, spatial reasoning\, and mat
 h without anyone noticing (shh\, it’s our secret). Each class projects buil
 d from simple fixes to full-on outfits\, with plenty of chances to collabor
 ate\, laugh\, and make friends along the way. Your invited to the finale\,
 a showcase at the end of the last class where kids strut their reworked mas
 terpieces like the fashion icons they secretly are. They leave with one-of-
 a-kind reworks\, new skills\, and a confidence boost that may or may not in
 volve dramatic runway poses in your living room.</p>
