DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/crows-are-white-screening
 -at-the-firehouse-tickets-955899520197?aff=oddtdtcreator">Crows are White S
 creening at the Firehouse Tickets\, Fri\, Aug 2\, 2024 at 7:00 PM | Eventbr
 ite</a><br><br>7PM - 9PM/9:30PM<p><i><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch
 ?v=GAvz0rfu4ds" target="_blank">Crows are White</a></i></p><p>Crows are Whi
 te premiered at SXSW and has garnered numerous Best Documentary awards duri
 ng its extensive festival run\, including screenings at BFI London\, Palm S
 prings\, Camerimage\, Hot Docs\, and more.</p><ul><li><p>You can view the<a
  href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GAvz0rfu4ds" target="_blank"><u> tra
 iler here</u></a></p></li></ul><p><b>Short Synopsis:</b></p><p>After decade
 s of living a secret life\, a filmmaker travels to a strict Japanese monast
 ery in search of guidance but the only monk who will help him prefers ice c
 ream and heavy metal over meditation. Crows are White is an exploration of
 truth\, faith and love\, from the top of a mountain to the bottom of a sund
 ae.</p>
