DESCRIPTION:What is artist circle?  A bunch of artists of all mediums sit d
 own and create in the same space while sharing mealtime\, conversation and
 camaraderie. <br><br><br>Laugh\, get out and meet people\, work on your own
  stuff and see what everyone else is working on.  We meet on the 2nd Monday
  of the month.<br><br>This new group plans to meet on the second Monday of
 every month from 12:00 noon - 2:30 PM with the goal of working on individua
 l projects while sharing creative energies and inspiration and conversation
  in a casual\, supportive gathering. All interested individuals are invited
  to bring whatever creative project they have in process to work on. No fee
 s. Donations to The Firehouse are welcomed but not required. Bring a friend
  or meet new ones. If you have any questions and/ or think you might come\,
  please send a text to Kathy Hall at 303-746-0629 so we know approximately
 how many to set up for. Thank you.<br><br>Sign up here- <a href="https://ww
 w.eventbrite.com/e/firehouse-artists-circle-tickets-372984054347">Firehouse
  Artist's Circle Tickets\, Multiple Dates | Eventbrite</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20250214T165152Z
LOCATION:Firehouse Art Center\, Longmont\, Colorado\, United States\, 80501
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Firehouse Artist's Circle
