DESCRIPTION:<h1>1st and 3rd Mondays- Make a Mystical Creature with Joyanna-
  2 sessions</h1>Sign up <a href="https://www.hisawyer.com/firehouse-art-cen
 ter-1/schedules/activity-set/1219022">Firehouse Art Center - Mystical Creat
 ures in Clay</a><br><br><h2>Event description</h2><p>1st and 3rd Mondays- M
 ake a Mystical Creature with Joyanna- 2 sessions<br>Make a creature! Fairie
 s\, trolls\, goblins\, witches\, elves\, mermaids\, and gnomes... fashion y
 our very own fae folk in ceramic. Open to all skill levels 12&amp\;up. We w
 ill use handbuilding techniques to create a Fairy Tale Friend\, then return
  in two weeks to paint and finish it. Students can learn basic handbuilding
  skills or expand on what they already know.<br><br>$45 for the 2 session c
 lass- supplies and firing included<br><br>Ages- This is a class for adults
 and mature children. Ages 12+ can attend  (Homeschool students welcome)<br>
 <br>Min/Max number of students- 8<br><br>Meet your instructor- Joyanna Rose
  Gittings<br>Joyanna Rose Gittings is a painter\, teacher\, and arts activi
 st in the city of Longmont\, Colorado. She grew up in rural Ohio\, studied
 language and culture in la Laguna\, Tenerife\, Spain\, and holds a BFA in T
 heatrical Design and Production from the University of Cincinnati College-
 Conservatory of Music.She comes from a family of creators\, and has raised
 a family of more creators\; her four children each have their own artistic
 interests.<br>In both her work as a painter and a linguist\, she is interes
 ted in the similarities we humans share\, regardless of our apparent differ
 ences. She plays with storytelling\, color abstraction\, and fantasy\, cros
 sing techniques learned from watercolor\, scenic lighting\, automotive pins
 triping and scrollwork\, and sculpture.<br>Her studio is regularly open to
 the public while she works.<br>For more information please visit <a href="w
 ww.joyannarose.com">www.joyannarose.com</a></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20250216T222004Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:1st and 3rd Mondays- Make a Mystical Creature with Joyanna- 2 sessi
 ons
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
