DESCRIPTION:Learn how to carve stone (alabaster) for beginning students.  Y
 ou will learn the whole process of stone carving\, from chisels to files an
 d the finishing process.  Students are helped and encouraged to create the
 style of work that interests them!  Class demonstrations will accompany pea
 ceful hours of working and connecting to the stone.  No previous experience
  required!  Tools are included\, stone is additional cost.  On the first da
 y of class you will purchase your stone from instructor at $1.50 a lb. Piec
 es can be as small as 5 lbs.\n\nPlease register by clicking on the Buy Now
 button on the right you can enter payment by debit or credit card.\n\nThis
 is a six class package priced at $175 total.\n\nIt is apprx. $30 for each c
 lass.                            \n\nOur current classes are:
                           \n\nSaturday mornings 10 am to 12 pm\n\nSeptember
  1st - September 13 (Wedding on 6th!}\n\nWednesday evenings 6:30 pm - 8:30p
 m\n\nSeptember 12 - October 17\n\nLimit 4 students!\n\nPlease call or text
 with questions. 303-260-8669\n\nLocation:  Longmont Firehouse Art Center\n\
 n667 4th Avenue\, Longmont\, CO                                       Thank
  you for your interest!
