DESCRIPTION:<br>CHALKMONT AT RHYTHM AT ROOSEVELT<br>Apply here to be a Chal
 k Artist for Chalkmont- <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/u/1/d/e/1FAI
 pQLSfLQGIxZn1SBa2dxJGvoDc0rlk_s7awpi5HflxbmpMM7nWaVw/viewform?fbclid=IwZXh0
 bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExODhtNkJPSEhvM3B1RnRKNgEerKsm_ebIepBB5cb0ZCSvWf0m91efxAT
 IKTCfj1RWFe8nOWi10UEsDNbkEIQ_aem_FALrlfVASYsNyZIp4PK8Og" target="_blank">ht
 tps://docs.google.com/.../1FAIpQLSfLQGIxZn1SBa.../viewform</a><br><br>Chalk
 mont is kicking off Longmont Art Week at Rhythm at Roosevelt.<br>Celebrate
 30 years of Rhythm at this year’s Rhythm at Roosevelt! Join us Saturday\, S
 eptember 6 for the final Rhythm festival with a full day of free music\, ar
 t\, food\, and fun in Roosevelt Park. This special anniversary edition hono
 rs three decades of community\, creativity\, and unforgettable performances
  in the heart of Longmont.<br>DATE: SEPT. 6\, 2025<br>TIME TO CREATE: 2PM-7
 PM<br>VOTING FOR PEOPLE’S CHOICE CLOSES: 8PM<br>SET UP: 12PM-2PM<br>During
 CHALKMONT AT RHYTHM\, 10 adult (4’x4′ square) and 10 youth (3′ x 3′ square)
  community artists will join together to create chalk art throughout 4th Av
 enue. These artists will turn concrete into a vivid canvas of colorful chal
 k art.<br>WHAT YOU’LL SEE : Creating these amazing works of art requires mo
 re than just scribbling on the sidewalk. First\, the artist must draw an ou
 tline of the original painting in proper proportion using pencil or a charc
 oal pastel. Then they begin to lay the base of colors. Using a number of co
 lored pastels\, the artist layers the chalk\, blending the colors to create
  shadow\, contrast and depth. The art may not last long\, but that’s sort o
 f the point.<br>Feeling inspired? There will be DIY art stations on the Str
 eet for artists of all ages to give Chalk art a try!<br>HOW TO VOTE? Visit
 the Firehouse Artist Booth and donate $1 or more for a voting token. Tokens
  will be counted after 8pm and the People will crown one adult and one yout
 h artist as the winner! Winners get a $100 LDDA gift card.
LAST-MODIFIED:20250725T172031Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Chalkmont at Rhythm at Roosevelt
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
