DESCRIPTION:Join Loki and AJ for beginner tango lessons!\nEvery lesson is b
 eginner friendly and requires no dance partner\, no experience\, and no spe
 cial shoes to attend!\n\nWe will have a lesson starting at 5:30\, Level 0\,
  which will be a fundamentals class\; then another lesson at 6:30\, Level 1
 \, which will be a step up from the fundamentals.\nIf you are unsure of you
 r level\, here's what we intend:\nLevel 0 is when you are not ready to be a
  social dancer at a Milonga (Tango social dance) yet.\nLevel 1 is when you
 are just starting to be social at a Milonga\, or you take the Level 0 class
  and think that it wasn't so bad.\nTLDR\n5:30 - Beginner 0\n6:30 - Beginner
  1\n$15 per class\, $25 for both\nCash or Venmo preferred\nWe don't have a
 credit card reader (yet)\nEmail: TangoDelFuturo@gmail.com
